msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC024_TITLE"
msgstr "Deal damage"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC030_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Win three consecutive battles.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't succeed on your first try, obtain the mission from the Armory and try again."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC030_TITLE"
msgstr "Napoleon's Tactics"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC031_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Win five consecutive battles.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't succeed on your first try, obtain the mission from the Armory and try again."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC031_TITLE"
msgstr "Emperor's Triumph"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC032_SQUAD_WIN_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Win a battle as part of a Division created in the Port and comprising at "
"least three players."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC032_SQUAD_WIN_TITLE"
msgstr "Win a battle"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC037_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Destroy an enemy ship while playing a ship designated as a Bounty.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the mission, obtain the Bounty marker in the Armory. The marker will remain active for the first five battles."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC037_TITLE"
msgstr "Bounty: Destroy an Enemy Ship"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC049_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Earn an \"Assisted in destruction\" ribbon while playing a ship designated as a Bounty.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the mission, obtain the Bounty marker in the Armory. The marker will remain active for the first five battles."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC049_TITLE"
msgstr "Bounty: Earn a Ribbon"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC061_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Survive a battle while playing a ship designated as a Bounty.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the mission, obtain the Bounty marker in the Armory. The marker will remain active for the first five battles."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC061_TITLE"
msgstr "Bounty: Survive a Battle"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC062_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Fight a battle playing a ship designated as a Bounty.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the mission, obtain the Bounty marker in the Armory. The marker will remain active for the first five battles.\n"
"\n"
"Can be completed only playing the following ships: Prinz Eugen, Bismarck, Bismarck '41, Eiserner Kanzler."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC062_TITLE"
msgstr "Bounty: Operation Rheinübung"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC063_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Destroy an enemy ship that has the Bounty marker.\n"
"\n"
"Can be completed only playing the following ships: Hood, Rodney, Ark Royal, Cossack, King George V, Prince of Wales."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_PCOC063_TITLE"
msgstr "Bounty Hunter: Pursuit of Bismarck"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_ANTI_AIR_DIVISION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"When playing together in a Division, each Recruiter and Shipmate must "
"destroy at least 20 enemy aircraft."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_ANTI_AIR_DIVISION_TITLE"
msgstr "Destroy enemy aircraft"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_EVERYONE_GOT_ONE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"When playing together in a Division, each Recruiter and Shipmate must "
"destroy at least one ship."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_EVERYONE_GOT_ONE_TITLE"
msgstr "Destroy a ship"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_MORE_THAN_COORDINATED_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Destroy seven enemy ships as part of a Division of the Recruiter and "
"Shipmates."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_MORE_THAN_COORDINATED_TITLE"
msgstr "Destroy ships"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_3TYPE_RIBBONS_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"While playing together in a Division, each Recruiter and Shipmate must earn "
"at least six \"Set on fire,\" \"Caused flooding,\" or \"Citadel hits\" "
"ribbons."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_3TYPE_RIBBONS_TITLE"
msgstr "Earn ribbons"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_CAPTURE_RIBBONS_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"When playing together in a Division, the Recruiter and Shipmates must earn a"
" combined total of at least four \"Captured\" or \"Assisted in capture\" "
"ribbons."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_CAPTURE_RIBBONS_TITLE"
msgstr "Earn ribbons"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_DIFFERENT_RIBBONS_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"When playing together in a Division, the Recruiter and Shipmates must earn a combined total of 12 or more different ribbons.\n"
"\n"
"In doing so, each Recruiter and Shipmate must earn at least four different ribbons."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_DIFFERENT_RIBBONS_TITLE"
msgstr "Earn ribbons"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_SPOT_DAMAGE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Help your team deal damage to enemies spotted by a Recruiter and Shipmates playing in a Division. The damage caused must amount to at least 25%% of the base HP of all enemy ships.\n"
"\n"
"In doing so, the Recruiter and Shipmates must collectively deal damage that is equal to at least 25%% of the base HP of all enemy ships."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_SPOT_DAMAGE_TITLE"
msgstr "Help your team deal damage"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_TOP3_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"When playing together in a Division, each Recruiter and Shipmate must "
"survive the battle and finish among the top 3 XP earners on the team."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_TOP3_TITLE"
msgstr "Survive and be among the top 3 XP earners"

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_VICTORY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Win a battle as part of a Division of the Recruiter and Shipmates."

msgid "IDS_ACHIEVEMENT_CONDITION_REF_SQUAD_VICTORY_TITLE"
msgstr "Win a battle"

