"chance of victory is 35%."

msgid "IDS_ADECK_RULES_POWER_LIST_P2"
msgstr ""
"If the lower limit of the range is higher than the enemy's total power, your"
" chance of victory is 100%."

msgid "IDS_ADECK_RULES_POWER_LIST_P3"
msgstr ""
"If the enemy's total power lies within your ship's total power range, the "
"chance of victory is calculated based on how much the upper limit of your "
"card's range is higher than the enemy's total power. Your chance of victory "
"can be between 36% and 99%."

msgid "IDS_ADECK_RULES_POWER_P1"
msgstr ""
"Total power represents the strength of individual cards—both your cards and "
"enemy cards. It is calculated as the sum of three parameters: survivability,"
" damage, and evasion. Total power is also affected by buffs from other cards"
" on your playfield and by each card's ship HP."

msgid "IDS_ADECK_RULES_POWER_P2"
msgstr ""
"Total power is the main factor that determines your chance of victory."

msgid "IDS_ADECK_RULES_POWER_P3"
msgstr ""
