msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_1"
msgstr "Italian Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_10"
msgstr "Holiday Convoy Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_10_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"By completing combat missions or exchanging Steel, Coal, and Research Points"
" starting from Update 15.7 and continuing until the end of the event in "
"Update 16.0."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_10_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Can be exchanged for Doubloons or used to obtain bundles containing rare, "
"epic, and legendary ships. Featured ships, including Tier VIII battleship "
"Bismarck '41, Tier X cruiser Kitakami, and Tier X battleship New Jersey, "
"become available at different times between Updates 15.7 and 16.0. You can "
"spend the Tokens starting from Update 15.7 and until the end of Update 16.0."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_10_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_11"
msgstr "Colorful Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_11_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From Colorful Regatta Premium containers, as well as by ranking in the event"
" Leaderboards until the end of Update 15.7."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_11_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Can be exchanged for Tier X battleship Conqueror CLR, Tier X cruiser "
"Zaō CLR, Tier X destroyer Kléber CLR, Tier IX cruiser Roon CLR, and "
"Tier VIII battleship North Carolina CLR; 10-skill-point Commanders; special "
"flags; and other items in the Armory event category until the end of "
"Update 15.7."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_11_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource of the Colorful Regatta event"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_12"
msgstr "Memory Notes"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_12_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For constructing areas and upgrading them to new levels until the end of the"
" Liberty Harbor event."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_12_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Memory Notes will automatically fill the progress bar in the Memory Box area"
" during the event in Updates 14.9–14.11."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_12_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_13"
msgstr "Progress Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_13_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For collecting Black Friday ships during a limited time in Updates "
"14.10–14.11."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_13_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Progress Tokens automatically fill a progress bar for the Black Friday "
"Squadron event in the Armory and bring you various rewards like Black Friday"
" containers, Steel, and Research Points for a limited time in "
"Updates 14.10–14.11."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_13_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_14"
msgstr "Warp Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_14_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From bundles in the Armory and Premium Shop, as well as part of common "
"rewards until the end of Update 14.10."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_14_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the Wishing Wharf event in the Armory until the end of Update 14.10. "
"The Wishing Wharf can bring you themed Tier VIII and Tier X ships, themed "
"permanent camouflages, and other items."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_14_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource for the Wishing Wharf event"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_1_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From random bundles in the Armory, as well as by exchanging Coal, Research "
"Points, and Free XP until the end of Update 15.5."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_1_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"On sequential bundles that hold Early Access Italian submarines Tier X "
"Pietro Calvi and Tier VIII Pietro Micca; permanent camouflages and bonus "
"packages for them; Italian Battleships containers; the Blue Explosion enemy "
"destruction effect; and other items in the Armory until the end of Update "
"15.5."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_1_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_2"
msgstr "Wharf Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_2_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From bundles in the Armory and in the Premium Shop, as well as from the "
"Wishing Wharf as common rewards and as compensation when receiving supreme "
"and rare rewards you already have until the end of Update 15.4."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_2_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the Wishing Wharf event in the Armory until the end of Update 15.4. "
"The Wishing Wharf can bring you new Naval Legacy Line Tier VIII battleship "
"Eiserner Kanzler and Tier VIII battleships Bismarck '41 and Prince of Wales."
" You can also obtain Tier VIII cruiser Prinz Eugen, Tier VIII destroyer "
"Cossack, Tier VII battleships Rodney and Hood, and Tier VI aircraft carrier "
"Ark Royal, as well as themed permanent camouflages, the Last Sortie enemy "
"destruction effect, and other items."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_2_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource for the Wishing Wharf event"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_3"
msgstr "Wharf Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_3_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From bundles in the Armory and in the Premium Shop, as well as from "
"the Wishing Wharf as common rewards until the end of Update 15.8."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_3_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the Wishing Wharf event in the Armory until the end of Update 15.8. "
"The Wishing Wharf can bring you Tier VIII–X ships, including Naval Legacy "
"Line Tier IX cruiser Chikuma Shō-Gō and Tier IX battleship Friedrich Carl, "
"as well as a permanent camouflage for Friedrich Carl, Decals Premium "
"containers, and other items."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_3_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource for the Wishing Wharf event"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_4"
msgstr "Festive Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_4_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Received as battle performance bonuses until the end of Update 15.8."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_4_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For supership Kurama, new collection containers, Supercontainers, a bonus "
"package for superships, and other items in the Armory until the end of "
"Update 15.8."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_4_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_5"
msgstr "Wharf Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_5_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From bundles in the Armory and in the Premium Shop, as well as from the "
"Wishing Wharf as common rewards until the end of Update 15.6."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_5_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the Wishing Wharf event in the Armory until the end of Update 15.6. "
"The Wishing Wharf can bring you new Tier X battleship Conte Verde. You can "
"also obtain Tier X battleship Rhode Island, Tier IX destroyer Nanning, Tier "
"IX cruisers Cambridge and Suzuya, and Tier IX battleship Tsurugi, as well as"
" other ships, permanent camouflages, and more items."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_5_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource for the Wishing Wharf event"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_6"
msgstr "Pan-American Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_6_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From random bundles in the Armory, as well as from a bundle that will become"
" obtainable for Doubloons after you complete combat missions in a special "
"category until the end of Update 15.8."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_6_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Can be exchanged for sequential bundles with Early Access Tier VIII "
"destroyer Cuauhtémoc and Tier IX destroyer Nueva Esparta; permanent "
"camouflages and bonus packages for Tier VIII Cuauhtémoc, Tier IX Nueva "
"Esparta, and Tier X 20 de Julio; and other items in the event category of "
"the Armory until the end of Update 15.8. Upon obtaining all sequential "
"bundles for Pan-American Tokens, you will be able to obtain Tier X destroyer"
" 20 de Julio for Doubloons."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_6_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_7"
msgstr "Exchange Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_7_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Received automatically in exchange for Free XP epic economic bonuses at a "
"rate of 1:1 with the release of Update 15.7. Each Free XP epic economic "
"bonus is converted into one Exchange Token."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_7_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Can be exchanged for legendary expendable economic bonuses of any type in "
"the Armory at the rate of 1:1 until the end of Update 15.7. Available "
"bonuses include Credit, XP, Commander XP, and Free XP legendary expendable "
"economic bonuses. If not exchanged, the Tokens will be automatically "
"converted into legendary Free XP expendable economic bonuses at the start of"
" Update 15.8."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_7_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_8"
msgstr "Summer Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_8_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"As a bonus when purchasing certain bundles for Doubloons in the event "
"category of the Armory and Premium Shop until the end of Update 15.6."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_8_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Tokens will automatically fill the progress bar in the Summer Festival "
"category of the Armory to bring you Santa's containers, containers with "
"Premium ships, Firepower IX Premium containers, Firepower X Premium "
"containers, and other items until the end of Update 15.6."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_8_STATUS"
msgstr "Temporary resource"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_9"
msgstr "Salvage Tokens"

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_9_GET_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "By completing Personal Challenges until the end of Update 15.6."

msgid "IDS_CURRENCY_EVENTUM_9_SPEND_DESCRIPTION"
