msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY508_CRASHCREW_FA2022"
msgstr ""
"Eliminates instances of flooding and prevents the spread of bacteria.\n"
"\n"
"Not a medication, but it has negative side effects. Consult an expert before using."

