msgstr ""
"Summons an air group with Smoke Curtain Generator to a designated area. The air group generates a smokescreen that reduces the risk of allied ships being detected by the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"These aircraft cannot spot hostile ships."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY603_SABOTAGE_AFD2024"
