"The opposing team stops receiving points and the allied team stops losing "
"them."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY604_RECONNAISSANCESQUAD_AFD2024"
msgstr ""
"Summons bombers to a designated area. They automatically drop HE bombs on "
"enemy ships."

