msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB125_NAME"
msgstr "Go Navy!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB126_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The tradition of honoring the Russian Navy at the end of July dates back to "
"the 18th century. Peter the Great decided to celebrate the day of victory in"
