msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP041_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"On November 1, 1943, with battleships laying down covering fire, U.S. "
"Marines landed on the island of Bougainville in the Empress Augusta Bay with"
" the aim of establishing a beachhead. In response, Japan sortied aviation "
"and a squadron of cruisers. The ensuing naval battle lasted till November 2 "
"and ended in a complete victory for the U.S. naval force."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP041_NAME"
msgstr "Cherry Blossom"

