msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP111_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "In celebration of the Legend of the Galactic Heroes."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP111_NAME"
msgstr "Star Fleet"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP112_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "In celebration of the Legend of the Galactic Heroes."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP112_NAME"
msgstr "Reinhard Fleet"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP113_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "In celebration of the Legend of the Galactic Heroes."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP113_NAME"
msgstr "Kircheis Fleet"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP114_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Nikolai Polikarpov is a prominent aeronautical engineer known for creating "
"fighter aircraft. That said, the first strike planes adopted by the Soviet "
"Air Forces were also designed by the Bureau he led."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP114_NAME"
msgstr "Polikarpov Bureau"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP115_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"After designing a notable series of naval reconnaissance aircraft, Igor "
"Chyetverikov's Bureau designed a carrier-borne torpedo bomber for the needs "
"of Soviet naval aviation."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP115_NAME"
msgstr "Chyetverikov Bureau"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP116_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Sergey Kocherygin designed a whole series of outstanding aircraft of various"
" types, with dive bombers being the most advanced new aircraft created by "
"his Design Bureau."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP116_NAME"
msgstr "Kocherygin Bureau"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP117_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"On July 9, 1944, the three-week battle for Saipan ended. With the support of"
" the Navy, the U.S. Marines took control of the island, which became one of "
"the key positions in the Pacific campaign. The next day, July 10, 1944, U.S."
" Navy light aircraft carrier USS Saipan was laid down."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP117_NAME"
msgstr "USS Saipan"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP118_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In the 1920s and 30s, large German Navy warships were typically named after "
"their predecessors that had perished in World War I. Pre-dreadnought "
"battleship Pommern, named after the province on the coast of the Baltic Sea,"
" was sunk during the Battle of Jutland."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP118_NAME"
msgstr "Pommern"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP119_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From time immemorial, Mount Yoshino has been famous for its hillsides dotted"
" with sakura trees. The first ship of the Imperial Japanese Navy was named "
"after this mountain. She was a protected cruiser that was eventually "
"destroyed during the war against Russia in 1904."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP119_NAME"
msgstr "Yoshino"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP120_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Dunkerques were designed to counter the German Deutschland-class pocket "
"battleships. When they were commissioned, only the last existing "
"battlecruisers of the British Royal Navy and Imperial Japanese Navy were "
"their equals."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP120_NAME"
msgstr "Dunkerque"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP121_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The coat of arms of the light cruiser Belfast depicting a seahorse as part "
"of the large coat of arms of the capital of Northern Ireland—the city of "
"Belfast."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP121_NAME"
msgstr "HMS Belfast"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP122_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Best regards to all voyagers."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP122_NAME"
msgstr "This is the Chinese Navy!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP123_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "For the glorious winners of Copa Latina-Americana Warships 2022."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP123_NAME"
msgstr "CLAW Multi-Champion"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP124_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "For participants of the \"Around the World\" web campaign."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP124_NAME"
msgstr "Compass"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP125_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The fierce and furious expression of the tiger is a symbol of lively and "
"prosperous celebrations. Gongs and firecrackers explode everywhere, "
"permeated with festive cheer!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP125_NAME"
msgstr "The Year We Roar Together"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP126_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The bow ornament of squadron pre-dreadnought battleship Kearsarge, which was"
" in service from 1900 to 1923. The tradition of gracing the bows of warships"
" with richly decorated figureheads existed in the U.S. Navy right until the "
"era of big battleships."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP126_NAME"
msgstr "USS Kearsarge"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP127_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the 1920s and 30s, light cruisers of the German Navy were named after"
" Imperial German Navy \"small cruisers\" that perished during World War I. "
"SMS Mainz was sunk on August 28, 1914, during the Battle of Heligoland "
"Bight."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP127_NAME"
msgstr "Mainz"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP128_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Translated from Japanese, Shinonome means \"daybreak.\" Mount Fuji, a sacred"
" symbol in Japanese culture, is depicted in the rays of the rising sun."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP128_NAME"
msgstr "Shinonome"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP129_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"To celebrate the many military vehicles featured in Wargaming titles over "
"the years."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP129_NAME"
msgstr "World of Military Machines"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP130_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "To celebrate the fifth anniversary of the game's release on Steam."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP130_NAME"
msgstr "Steam"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP131_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In the early 14th century, when the Kingdom of Naples was under the reign of"
" the Angevin dynasty, the city of Naples came to be symbolized by a "
"combination of gold and red colors. In 1866, the shield depicted on the coat"
" of arms of Naples was stamped with a turreted city crown, a heraldic symbol"
" of \"municipal independence.\""

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP131_NAME"
msgstr "Napoli"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP132_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"To celebrate the second anniversary of the game's release in the Epic Games "
"Store."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP132_NAME"
msgstr "Epic"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP133_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Rotterdam's coat of arms is crossed by a white stripe that marks the Rotte "
"River. In the upper part, two red and two black lions symbolize Holland and "
"Hainaut, respectively. It is traditionally believed that the coat of arms "
"was granted to Rotterdam by William I the Good, Count of Holland and "
"Hainaut."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP133_NAME"
msgstr "Rotterdam"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP134_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In memory of the heroism of the crews of transports and escort ships that "
"participated in escorting Arctic convoy PQ-17."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP134_NAME"
msgstr "PQ-17"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP135_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Eight years of raging naval combat, thrilling emotions, and shining triumphs. Full ahead to fight tomorrow's battles!\n"
"\n"
"To mark the game's Eighth Anniversary."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP135_NAME"
msgstr "Parallel Worlds"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP136_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The years spanning 220 to 280 marked a significant chapter in China's "
"history known as the Three Kingdoms period—a time characterized by the "
"rivalry among three states: Wei, Wu, and Shu. The Three Kingdoms period, "
"although brief, stands as one of the most violent epochs in Chinese history."
" The events from that era are depicted in various artworks, including the "
"novel \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms\" authored by Chinese writer "
"Luo Guanzhong."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP136_NAME"
msgstr "Three Kingdoms Era"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP137_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Everybody's gotta start somewhere!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP137_NAME"
msgstr "Rookie"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP138_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"More than a century ago, on November 11, 1918, a truce was signed near the "
"French city of Compiègne, putting an end to hostilities on the fronts of "
"World War I, one of the largest conflicts in human history: a history "
"comprised of both desperate tragedies and great feats."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP138_NAME"
msgstr "The End of the Great War"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP139_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "To commemorate the \"Embracing Progress!\" event."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP139_NAME"
msgstr "Beyond Horizons"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP140_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"To celebrate the sixth anniversary of the game's release on the platform."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP140_NAME"
msgstr "Xbox"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP141_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The game's knowledge base flourishes thanks to the unwavering dedication of "
"the World of Warships Wiki editors, who contribute invaluable insights on a "
"regular basis. They help their fellow players grasp the nuances of World of "
"Warships by crafting game mechanics guides and compiling information about "
"ships and in-game content."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP141_NAME"
msgstr "Wiki Team"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP142_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Once seen as a troublemaker during the Lunar New Year, Nian is now a "
"symbolic figure in its celebrations. In the past, she would visit Chinese "
"villages on the eve of the holiday, causing destruction and stealing "
"livestock. This continued until people realized that Nian was afraid of the "
"color red, loud sounds, and bright lights. Since then, fireworks, lanterns, "
"and dancing have become essential to the holiday."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP142_NAME"
msgstr "New Year Beast"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP143_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Japanese military personnel claimed that they had sunk the Enterprise CV-6 "
"several times during World War II, yet the ship defiantly reengaged Imperial"
" Japanese Navy forces, earning her nickname \"The Grey Ghost.\" The lineage "
"of ships named Enterprise dates back to 1775 when revolutionary forces "
"captured and renamed a British supply sloop named George. In a legacy "
"spanning over 240 years, seven ships have proudly borne the name Enterprise."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP143_NAME"
msgstr "Grey Ghost"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP144_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Diverse and abundant, resilient and enduring. Rockfish became the mascot of "
"the Commonwealth Team, represented by cruisers from Australia, New Zealand, "
"India, and Canada."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP144_NAME"
msgstr "Commonwealth Rockfish"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP145_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Often referred to as \"the beginning of the end of World War II,\" D-Day was"
" the largest amphibious operation ever executed. The landings began in the "
"early morning hours of June 6, 1944, when the first shots were fired by "
"Allied armada ships. Two of them, HMS Belfast and USS Texas, have been "
"preserved and turned into museum ships."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP145_NAME"
msgstr "Momentous Day"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP146_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Masters of sabotage, the French Resistance fighters aided the Normandy "
"Landings by working to incapacitate the enemy's infrastructure. They cut "
"telephone cables and destroyed strategically important railroads in an "
"effort to cut off Normandy in the days before D-Day."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP146_NAME"
msgstr "Symbol of the Resistance"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP147_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A flaming sword piercing through the darkness, symbolizing perseverance and "
"bravery, was used for the Supreme Headquarters, Allied Expeditionary Force "
"patch. Dwight D. Eisenhower approved the design of patches to be worn by his"
" aides on D-Day."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP147_NAME"
msgstr "Sword of Freedom"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP148_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Painters, designers, and actors—creative thinking was the prerequisite for "
"joining the famous Ghost Army. The top-secret U.S. unit misled the enemy "
"about Allied troop movements and plans by deploying fake tanks, phony "
"aircraft, and staging shortly before D-Day. They continued conducting their "
"activities to sow confusion in enemy intelligence until the end of the war."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP148_NAME"
msgstr "Ruse of War"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP149_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"As part of the collaboration with Marco Materazzi—the legendary Matrix."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP149_NAME"
msgstr "Matrix"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP150_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Why incapacitate one gun emplacement when you can destroy an entire hill? "
"USS Wisconsin made a name for herself as a ship with a bad temper. The story"
" goes that at the onset of the Korean War, the battleship was hit by a "
"155 mm enemy shell; in response, she fired a full broadside and obliterated "
"the enemy position. Her escort ship signaled \"Temper, Temper,\" etching the"
" phrase in history."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP150_NAME"
msgstr "\"Temper, Temper\""

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP151_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A professional cook and the owner of a ramen stall, Master Shiba always has hot ramen ready in case you're feeling hungry!\n"
"\n"
"As part of the collaboration with Blue Archive."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP151_NAME"
msgstr "Master Shiba"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP152_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The greatest carrier battle of World War II on June 19 and 20, 1944, ended "
"in a decisive victory for the U.S. Navy over the Imperial Japanese Navy, "
"with the Americans practically obliterating Japan's deck aviation. The "
"number of Japanese planes shot down was so big that one pilot is quoted as "
"saying, \"It was just like an old-time turkey shoot down home!\" The airmen "
"later nicknamed the battle as the \"Great Marianas Turkey Shoot.\""

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP152_NAME"
msgstr "Battle of the Philippine Sea"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP153_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Players who love WoWoNiang, unite!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP153_NAME"
msgstr "WoWoNiang Fanbase"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP154_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "I will show you the power of the protectors!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP154_NAME"
msgstr "Now, Let's Begin"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP155_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "I will give you the shock of your life!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP155_NAME"
msgstr "I, Benimaru Nikaido!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP156_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During World War II, the Royal Navy faced unprecedented challenges. The "
"Admiralty postponed many pre-war projects, including new powerful "
"battleships, to prioritize replenishing vital ship types—escort ships, "
"destroyers, and, of course, aircraft carriers."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP156_NAME"
msgstr "Royal Navy Challenges"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP157_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A Chinese character that represents \"Weapon,\" \"Kung Fu,\" \"Force,\" and "
"\"Valiant.\""

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP157_NAME"
msgstr "Chinese Character \"Wu\""

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP158_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For voyaging to a distant water world and having a blast celebrating the "
"game's Ninth Anniversary!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP158_NAME"
msgstr "Cosmic Cadet"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP159_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In 1984, Kevin Eastman and Peter Laird published their first comic book, "
"which began a story about the exciting adventures of four friends—teenage "
"turtles trained in ninjutsu by their sensei, Splinter. Over the years, the "
"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles have become one of the most beloved franchises "
"and a genuine cultural phenomenon, captivating fans of all ages. A great "
"sense of humor, thrilling action, and the spirit of camaraderie—these are "
"the things that make Leonardo, Raphael, Michelangelo, and Donatello all-time"
" favorite heroes."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP159_NAME"
msgstr "Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP160_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In the night sky, Jade Rabbit releases Kongming lanterns on the Moon, "
"surrounded by auspicious clouds, sending good wishes to the Captains on the "
"Mid-Autumn Festival."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP160_NAME"
msgstr "Blessings From Jade Rabbit"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP161_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The clash of massive fleets that ended in the near destruction of the "
"Imperial Japanese Navy saw the last battleship-to-battleship confrontation "
"in history during the Battle of Surigao Strait on October 25, 1944. This "
"engagement, part of the pivotal Battle of Leyte Gulf, marked the end of the "
"battleship supremacy era."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP161_NAME"
msgstr "Last Great Naval Battle"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP162_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "How did I win again?"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP162_NAME"
msgstr "Need to play harder"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP163_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enough! I no longer wish to be a gentleman—I just want to live happily as a "
"Captain."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP163_NAME"
msgstr "Single Dog"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP164_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Beiyang Fleet, established on December 17, 1888, at Liugong Island in "
"Weihai, was the most renowned modern naval force in China. Cruiser Zhiyuan "
"was ordered by the Beiyang Fleet from the United Kingdom. During the First "
"Sino-Japanese War, Cruiser Zhiyuan engaged in fierce combat with Japanese "
"warships before her tragic sinking."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP164_NAME"
msgstr "Beiyang Fleet"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP165_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A symbol of dreams from the \"psplive\" virtual artist group."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP165_NAME"
msgstr "psplive"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP166_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Today is a good day to die.\n"
"\n"
"As part of the collaboration with STAR TREK."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP166_NAME"
msgstr "tlhIngan maH"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP167_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"We are Starfleet. Weird is just part of the job.\n"
"\n"
"As part of the collaboration with STAR TREK."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP167_NAME"
msgstr "Starfleet Delta"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP168_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Warp speed!\n"
"\n"
"As part of the collaboration with STAR TREK."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP168_NAME"
msgstr "U.S.S. Enterprise-D"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP169_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"After the successful raid on German battleship Bismarck in 1941, the Allies "
"made efforts to sink her sistership Tirpitz as well. A series of operations "
"aimed to achieve this goal, and finally, Operation Catechism was conducted. "
"This air raid of 29 bombers armed with Tallboy bombs managed to eliminate "
"the much-feared battleship Tirpitz."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP169_NAME"
msgstr "Operation Catechism"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP170_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Sabaton is a heavy metal band from Falun, Sweden, whose lore is based on "
"military history from all over the world. More recognizable than their "
"lyrics is their music. Born out of classic metal, Sabaton has forged their "
"unique power metal-inspired sound, fronted by the distinct voice of their "
"singer, Joakim Brodén."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP170_NAME"
msgstr "Sabaton"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP171_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A dedicated and passionate researcher, Li Wei is on a mission to unveil the secrets hidden in the Arctic ice.\n"
"\n"
"Part of the Wonders of the Arctic event."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP171_NAME"
msgstr "Avid Explorer"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP172_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In pursuit of another exciting challenge, Olaf Lundgren is determined not only to help an ambitious researcher but also to solve a family mystery!\n"
"\n"
"Part of the Wonders of the Arctic event."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP172_NAME"
msgstr "Polar Pursuit"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP173_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"USS Archerfish (hull number SS-311), named after a tiny fish renowned for "
"accurately shooting prey over the water, lived up to its name by sinking the"
" largest aircraft carrier of her time with a single torpedo salvo."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP173_NAME"
msgstr "USS Archerfish"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP174_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A dream that became a reality and spread throughout the stars.\n"
"\n"
"As part of the collaboration with STAR TREK."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP174_NAME"
msgstr "United Federation of Planets"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP175_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Grand Trial is a year-long challenge for Public Test participants—dedicated pioneers who help shape the game by testing new features and providing valuable feedback before updates go live. They complete special combat missions and earn exclusive rewards for their passion and commitment.\n"
"\n"
"For taking part in the Winter Phase of the Grand Trial."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP175_NAME"
msgstr "Grand Trial: Winter Phase"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP179_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"On February 16 and 17, 1940, crew members from British destroyer HMS Cossack"
" boarded German tanker Altmark to rescue interned British sailors. This "
"event is considered the last hand-to-hand naval fighting incident in "
"history. After the British won the boarding action, they greeted the "
"liberated sailors with the triumphant cry: \"The Navy's here!\" This phrase "
"later became the motto of HMS Cossack."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP179_NAME"
msgstr "Altmark Incident"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP180_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"From the shadowy depths, a periscope rises, scanning the endless expanse of "
"frigid waters. The silence, vast and heavy, is broken only by a faint sonar "
"ping. It's time to fire up the samovar—the night promises to be long."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP180_NAME"
msgstr "One Ping Only"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP182_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Armed forces from the British dominions of Australia and New Zealand were "
"involved in the ill-fated Gallipoli campaign during World War I, which some "
"modern commentators refer to as the \"First D-Day.\" The Entente "
"powers—Britain, France, and Russia—aimed to take control of the Ottoman "
"straits, but the campaign did not go as planned and resulted in heavy "
"casualties among Entente troops. Allied deaths totaled over 56,000, "
"including 8,709 from Australia and 2,721 from New Zealand."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP182_NAME"
msgstr "Gallipoli Landings"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP183_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Azur Lane reimagines legendary warships as shipgirls, blending naval warfare"
" with unique personalities and unfolding a world of adventure."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP183_NAME"
msgstr "Azur Lane"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP184_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In 1405, Zheng He set sail on the first of seven grand voyages, leading a "
"fleet of the largest ships of the time. Over nearly three decades, the fleet"
" visited more than 30 regions across Southeast Asia, South Asia, Arabia, and"
" East Africa, expanding China's influence across the Indian Ocean. Zheng He "
"returned to China with exotic goods and animals like giraffes and lions. "
"Meanwhile, his offerings of lavish gifts to foreign rulers solidified "
"China's prestige abroad. After his death during the final expedition, "
"official large-scale voyages were reduced due to China's shifting "
"priorities."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP184_NAME"
msgstr "Zheng He's Voyages"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP187_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Just give it a try."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP187_NAME"
msgstr "It's Okay to Take Two"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP188_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Grand Trial is a year-long challenge for Public Test participants—dedicated pioneers who help shape the game by testing new ships and providing valuable feedback before updates go live. They complete special combat missions and earn exclusive rewards for their passion and commitment.\n"
"\n"
"For taking part in the Spring Phase of the Grand Trial."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP188_NAME"
msgstr "Grand Trial: Spring Phase"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP189_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Grand Trial is a year-long challenge for Public Test participants—dedicated pioneers who help shape the game by testing new features and providing valuable feedback before updates go live. They can complete special combat missions and earn exclusive rewards for their passion and commitment.\n"
"\n"
"For taking part in the Summer Phase of the Grand Trial."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP189_NAME"
msgstr "Grand Trial: Summer Phase"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP190_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For completing every phase of the Grand Trial: Winter, Spring, Summer, and "
"Autumn. A mark of dedication, consistency, and year-round contribution to "
"shaping the future of the game."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP190_NAME"
msgstr "Grand Trial Champion"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP191_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Grand Trial is a year-long challenge for Public Test participants—dedicated pioneers who help shape the game by testing new features and providing valuable feedback before updates go live. They complete special combat missions and earn exclusive rewards for their passion and commitment.\n"
"\n"
"For taking part in the Autumn Phase of the Grand Trial."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP191_NAME"
msgstr "Grand Trial: Autumn Phase"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP194_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Captains, be vigilant! The waters ahead are alive with torpedoes. Keep your "
"eyes on the sea at all times when passing through. Avoid torpedoes and drive"
" safely."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP194_NAME"
msgstr "Attention: Torpedo Danger Area!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP195_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Every unshakeable Celestial Empire warrior volunteers to display the "
"Celestial Loong on their arms, won't you?"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP195_NAME"
msgstr "Celestial Loong"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP196_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For six long years, humanity stood firm against the darkness—and prevailed. "
"This was more than a victory on the battlefield. It was a triumph of unity, "
"spirit, and the dream of peace and a brighter future."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP196_NAME"
msgstr "We Did It"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP197_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "On the stage, the only goal is to knock the opponent out!"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNP197_NAME"
