msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_1_PARAGRAPH_1_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Months prior to the massive operation later known as D-Day, the Allies deceived the enemy into thinking that the invasion would commence near Pas-de-Calais, the closest French location to Great Britain.\n"
"\n"
"While the enemy's attention is drawn to another sector, you need to ensure the successful landing of troops on the Normandy beach, codenamed Utah."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_1_PARAGRAPH_2_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Clear the coast and coastal waters of enemy coastal fortifications and "
"combat units."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_1_TITLE_UPPER_CASE"
msgstr "Utah Beach"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_2_PARAGRAPH_1_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Kriegsmarine command have transferred additional forces from Norway to "
"France, but despite this, Allied forces off the adjacent coast have managed "
"to break through the Atlantic Wall and gain a foothold in Normandy. You must"
" do your best to thwart the attempt to land on your site. Use minefields to "
"hinder the enemy!"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_2_PARAGRAPH_2_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Prevent the Allies from breaking through the defenses. Thwart the landing "
"attempt!"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_2_TITLE_UPPER_CASE"
msgstr "Atlantic Wall Defense"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_3_PARAGRAPH_1_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"During the assault on Omaha Beach, Allied forces encountered serious "
"obstacles. Fierce enemy resistance and other difficulties are jeopardizing "
"the success of the operation in this sector. The Kriegsmarine command has "
"transferred additional forces from Norway to contain our advance. You'll "
"need to rescue the crews of sinking Allied ships and neutralize enemy forces"
" both onshore and at sea."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_BRIEFING_3_PARAGRAPH_2_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Rescue the crews of ships in distress and ensure a successful landing."

