msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_1_INDEX_0"
msgstr ""
"Captain's log, Stardate 43917.5. The Enterprise is entering Vulcan's orbit."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_1_INDEX_1"
msgstr ""
"While the research results are being presented at the interplanetary "
"conference, the Borg's approach has been noticed. They detected heightened "
"research activity and identified the universe's foremost scientists, "
"deciding to assimilate the researchers and absorb their technologies into "
"the Collective."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_1_INDEX_2"
msgstr ""
"You will confront Borg in three Operations. Complete them to earn Stars to "
"fill the reward track and obtain special modules. Mounting different modules"
" allows you to customize your ship and change the gameplay, as well as try "
"out new weapons and consumables."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_2_INDEX_0"
msgstr ""
"Here, the United Federation of Planets tests naval technologies to use in "
"scientific and defense missions on planet surfaces mostly covered by water. "
"Planet Vulcan provides all essential conditions for developing and analyzing"
" Romulan, Klingon, Earth, and Vulcan technologies."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_2_INDEX_1"
msgstr ""
"You must confront the Borg forces together with Starfleet and defend Vulcan "
"from their aggression. Helm ships of allied factions and modify them to "
"perform different roles in battle."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_2_INDEX_2"
msgstr ""
"You can also unlock \"Space, the Final Frontier\" collection elements. "
"Obtaining these will unlock battle bonuses to increase your combat "
"performance."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_HUB_ONBOARDING_PARAGRAPH_3_INDEX_2"
msgstr ""
"You can also obtain the fourth event ship, the aircraft carrier "
"Enterprise-D, from the reward track."

