msgstr "Management"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Classified Documents provide bonuses against specific ship types and "
"flagships, allowing you to customize your ship for the unique conditions of "
"each Operation."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"You can use Intel Tokens to upgrade Classified Documents, and higher levels "
"enhance their effects or unlock new ones. Levels will be introduced "
"gradually over three updates, starting in 14.4, with the maximum level (11) "
"to be available in Update 14.6. Upgrades apply globally and are not tied to "
"specific ships."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr ""
"Choose and apply a Classified Document under the Equipment tab in your Port."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_FLAGSHIPS_CARDS_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"If you change your mind, you can select a different one on the Document "
"Management screen at the start of each battle, but only for a limited time."

