msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Flagships are powerful warships with increased hit points, led by admirals "
"who command the enemy fleet according to their specializations."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"Each flagship influences the enemy ships in her command area by enhancing "
"their battle characteristics."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr ""
"Each flagship has particular vulnerabilities and abilities that she grants "
"the enemy ships in her command area. Learn them to counter these ships "
"better!"

