msgstr "Tip"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_10"
msgstr ""
"Try to destroy the flagship as quickly as possible to prevent her from "
"calling in motor boats."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Accelerates the reload time of enemy main battery guns. Increases the "
"chances of enemy destroyers setting targets on fire."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr "Flagship takes increased damage from fire."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"Upon detection, the flagship periodically calls in motor boats for "
"reinforcements."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Focus your attacks on the destroyers, as they have increased chances of "
"causing fires."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_FLAMMABLE_BB_PARAGRAPH_9"
msgstr ""
"Start two or more fires on enemy ships in the flagship's command area to "
"increase the fire damage they take."

