msgstr "Type-Specific Ability"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_HEADER_9"
msgstr "Tip"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_10"
msgstr ""
"Inflict damage to enemy ships within the flagship's command area using AP or"
" SAP shells. This will cause explosions on the enemy ships and negatively "
"impact their main battery reload time."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_11"
msgstr ""
"Target cruisers within the flagship's command area to prevent a new flagship"
" from being designated."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Accelerates the reload time of enemy main battery guns and increases "
"the armor penetration capability of their shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Flagship takes increased damage from armor-piercing (AP) shells and semi-"
"armor-piercing (SAP) shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"When the flagship is destroyed, a cruiser within her command area assumes "
"the role of the new flagship."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_7"
msgstr ""
"Unlike the original, the new flagship has no vulnerability or extra hit "
"points, but she does enhance enemy ships within her command area."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_CA_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Upon taking on the role, the new flagship receives temporary "
"buffs: increased main and secondary battery damage and instant torpedo tube "
"reload. She also benefits from gradual hit point restoration."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD"
msgstr "Iron Fist: Destroyer"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Specialization"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Vulnerability"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_HEADER_5"
msgstr "Type-Specific Ability"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_HEADER_8"
msgstr "Tip"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_10"
msgstr ""
"To prevent minelaying, eliminate all destroyers within the flagship's "
"command area, then destroy the flagship."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Accelerates the reload time of enemy main battery guns and increases "
"the armor penetration capability of their shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Flagship takes increased damage from armor-piercing (AP) shells and semi-"
"armor-piercing (SAP) shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"The flagship destroyer summons bombers to deploy minefields in the action "
"zone."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_7"
msgstr ""
"Destroyers within the flagship's command area can each deploy a minefield "
"once per battle. If a destroyer is eliminated before deploying it, she "
"explodes, dealing damage to all nearby ships."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_DD_PARAGRAPH_9"
msgstr ""
"Inflict damage to enemy ships within the flagship's command area using AP or"
" SAP shells. This will cause explosions on the enemy ships and negatively "
"impact their main battery reload time."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Specialization"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_HEADER_2"
msgstr "Vulnerability"

