msgstr "Type"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_PARAGRAPH_1"
msgstr ""
"Accelerates the reload time of enemy main battery guns and increases the "
"armor penetration capability of their shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Flagship takes increased damage from armor-piercing (AP) shells and semi-"
"armor-piercing (SAP) shells."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"Inflict some damage to enemy ships within the flagship's command area using "
"AP or SAP shells. This will cause explosions on the enemy ships, increasing "
"their main battery reload time."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_FLAGSHIPS_FLAGSHIPS_UNDERARMORED_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr "Battleship, cruiser, or destroyer."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Briefing"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Goal"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_HEADER_5"
msgstr "Support Consumables"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Your fleet's command ship has sustained heavy damage and is unable to fight "
"until her weapons systems are restored. Escort her to the destination while "
"fending off enemy attacks."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Complete main and secondary tasks along the way to ensure successful systems"
" repairs and safe arrival."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_BRIEFING_CONVOYS_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"You have access to the Coordinated Fleet Support consumable, which restores "
"a portion of the command ship and allied ships' HP. The recovery effects "
"stack when multiple allies activate it simultaneously."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Main Objectives"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Scouting the Area"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_HEADER_5"
msgstr "Capturing Key Area"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_HEADER_7"
msgstr "Eliminating Enemy Forces"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"As you escort the command ship to the destination, she will stop twice for "
"systems repairs. To proceed, you will need to complete one of three "
"randomized primary tasks—scouting, capturing a Key Area, or eliminating "
"enemy forces. If you are successful and the command ship survives, she will "
"join you in the final battle."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Scout the designated area and search for ambushing enemies while defending "
"the command ship."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"Secure a strategic Key Area while ensuring the command ship remains safe."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE039_TASKS_TASKS_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Defend the command ship and eliminate destroyers sent to intercept your "
"convoy."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_10"
msgstr "2022 (Week 5–6): Tier IX–X destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_11"
msgstr "Present (Week 7–8): Tier IX–X destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_6"
msgstr "2015 (Week 1): Tier V–VI destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_7"
msgstr "2017 (Week 2): Tier VII–VIII destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_8"
msgstr "2019 (Week 3): Tier VIII–IX destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_BULLET_9"
msgstr "2020 (Week 4): Tier IX–X destroyers, cruisers, and battleships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_HEADER_12"
msgstr "Maps and Modes"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_HEADER_4"
msgstr "Timeline and Rules"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_PARAGRAPH_13"
msgstr ""
"Just as ships are tied to key milestones in the game's history, so are maps."
" Battles take place on maps that were available or released during certain "
"periods in the past."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_PARAGRAPH_14"
msgstr ""
"This battle type includes only original game modes: Standard Battle, where "
"your goal is to capture the enemy base, and Domination, where you must seize"
" control of three or four Key Areas."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Relive the original World of Warships gameplay in ship-to-ship battles where"
" tactical decision-making plays a crucial role."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"Participate in 12 vs. 12 battles with only surface ship types allowed. In "
"the last two weeks of the event, hybrid ships and ships with special "
"mechanics like Airstrike, Combat Instructions, and alternative fire modes "
"will also be excluded."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE044_BRIEFING_CLASSIC_MODE_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr ""
"Each stage of the event is dedicated to a particular year in World "
"of Warships' history. You can only enter battle on ships released in or "
"before that year."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS"
msgstr "Equipment"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Missiles"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Special Consumable"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_HEADER_5"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Missiles let you strike enemies at range. Select a target zone on the map, "
"and the missile will travel there along a fixed trajectory. As it nears the "
"zone, it activates radar to scan for ships. If an enemy is detected, the "
"missile homes in and strikes the target; if not, it impacts at the center of"
" the marked zone."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Ships are equipped with the special Defense Systems consumable, which "
"reduces all incoming damage, including from missile strikes."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_ARMAMENTS_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"Attack enemies who least expect a missile strike—catching them off guard "
"will increase the impact."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Briefing"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_4"
msgstr "Goal"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_6"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"The temporal rift triggered by SABER-777 has cast the Alliance of New Earth "
"into an alternate past, where the Citadel of Return's base lies behind "
"defensive lines. Seize it before the Citadel can reshape history to their "
"design. To reach the base, break through two defense lines by capturing Key "
"Areas."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"In the final stage, strike the base to take control of the rift and "
"stabilize it."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr "Capture the base of the Citadel of Return."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_7"
msgstr ""
"Your effectiveness will determine the difficulty of the final battle. If you"
" fail to capture the Key Areas in the two defensive lines, you'll still have"
" a chance to seize the base, but the fight will be more challenging."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Enemy warships will be the main threat, and some will be armed with "
"missiles. Supporting them are forts, repair ships that restore HP, and "
"carriers that provide air support."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Features"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS"
msgstr "Respawns"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_HEADER_4"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"When your ship is destroyed, a countdown begins. Choose a sector on the map "
"to respawn in; if you don't select one before the timer expires, a respawn "
"sector will be chosen automatically."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"When you respawn, all armaments will be reloaded and consumables fully "
"restored."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr "Select respawn sectors that will best support your team's efforts."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_SHIPS"
msgstr "Ships"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_SHIPS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_SHIPS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete secondary Operation tasks to earn Stars and progress along the "
"reward track under the Temporal Rift banner in the Port. Certain levels "
"grant Tokens to be spent on ships and upgrades under the same banner."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE050_BRIEFING_SHIPS_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"You can take command of six different ships, each built around artillery, "
"torpedoes, or missiles as their primary strength. Every ship comes with a "
"full set of weapons, but their advantage lies in one. Upgrades can be "
"mounted to adjust the ships' unique playstyles and boost their performance."

