msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Briefing"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_4"
msgstr "Goal"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_6"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Your efforts have paid off, and you have managed to partially stabilize the "
"rift. The Citadel of Return is rallying to retake the base. Enemy ships, "
"some equipped with missiles, are advancing through two defensive lines, each"
" with three Key Areas. Hold them to ensure the base remains fully protected!"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"In the final battle, you will defend the base—if the enemy seizes it, the "
"rift will destabilize and history will be rewritten."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr "Do not let the Citadel of Return capture the base."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_7"
msgstr ""
"Your effectiveness will determine the difficulty of the final battle. If you"
" fail to stay in control of the Key Areas in the two defensive lines, the "
"final fight for the base will be more challenging."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Supporting your efforts and defending the base are forts, repair ships, and "
"carriers."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Features"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS"
msgstr "Respawns"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE051_BRIEFING_RESPAWNS_HEADER_1"
