msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE052_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Goal"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE052_BRIEFING_FEATURES_HEADER_5"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE052_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"After fierce battles, the forces of the New Earth Alliance have faced yet "
"another threat. The rift has slipped out of control, distorting the flow of "
"time. Your forces are scattered across alternate timelines, forced to "
"confront the Citadel—attacking and defending the base over and over, trying "
"to stabilize the rift once and for all."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE052_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr "Capture the base or hold it, depending on the timeline you enter."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE052_BRIEFING_FEATURES_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"Your effectiveness will determine the difficulty of the final battle. If you"
" fail to capture or hold the Key Areas in the two lines, the final "
"stage—whether attacking or defending the base—will be more challenging."

