msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_CAPTUREPOINTS_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Key Areas"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_CAPTUREPOINTS_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_CAPTUREPOINTS_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"There are four Key Areas on the map. Two are neutral and located along the "
"center line—capture and hold them to earn points for your team. The "
"remaining two are bases. They don't generate points, but capturing an enemy "
"base results in an instant victory."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_CAPTUREPOINTS_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr "To disrupt the enemy's capture, enter the Key Area and open fire."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_FEATURES_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Team Mission"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_FEATURES_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_FEATURES_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Score 1,000 points before the enemy team by capturing Key Areas and "
"destroying their ships."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_FEATURES_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr ""
"Each team starts with a home base.\n"
"Capture the enemy base to earn an instant victory."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_RETURNTOBATTLE_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Respawns"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_RETURNTOBATTLE_DESCRIPTION_HEADER_4"
msgstr "Tips"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_RETURNTOBATTLE_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"When your ship is destroyed, a countdown begins. Choose a sector on the map "
"to respawn in; if you don't select one before the timer expires, a respawn "
"sector will be chosen automatically."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_RETURNTOBATTLE_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_3"
msgstr ""
"Upon respawning, all consumables and armament will be ready and reloaded, "
"except for torpedoes. If your ship is destroyed while torpedoes are still "
"reloading, they will start a new reloading cycle upon respawning; if they "
"were fully reloaded, they will remain ready."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_PCVE053_RETURNTOBATTLE_DESCRIPTION_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr "Select respawn sectors that will best support your team's efforts."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_HEADER_1"
msgstr "Team Mission"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_HEADER_10"
msgstr "Commander Talents"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_HEADER_12"
msgstr "Temporary Enhancements"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_HEADER_3"
msgstr "Return to Battle"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_HEADER_7"
msgstr "Equipment Reload"

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_11"
msgstr ""
"Unique Commanders' talents cannot be activated in this battle type and will "
"remain inactive for the entire battle."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_13"
msgstr ""
"After returning to battle, you will receive an \"Esprit de Corps\" buff that"
" improves your ship's characteristics."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_2"
msgstr ""
"Score 1,000 points before the enemy team by capturing Key Areas and "
"destroying their ships."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_4"
msgstr "After your ship is destroyed in battle, a countdown timer will start."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_5"
msgstr ""
"When the timer runs down, you will rejoin the battle at a randomly chosen "
"location on the map."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_6"
msgstr ""
"If you leave the battle before it ends and while the timer is running, you "
"will be penalized."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_8"
msgstr ""
"Upon rejoining the battle, all squadrons and armaments will be fully "
"reloaded, except for torpedoes. If your ship is destroyed while torpedoes "
"are reloading, they will start a new cycle upon returning; if they were "
"fully reloaded, they will remain ready."

msgid "IDS_EVENT_WIKI_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_RESPAWNS_PARAGRAPH_9"
msgstr ""
"All consumables will be ready to use, but charges of limited-use consumables"
" will not be restored."

