msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_1_T0"
msgstr "Capture Key Areas and break through the enemy's defenses."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_2_T0"
msgstr "Capture any Key Area and gain an advantage in your attack!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_3_T0"
msgstr "The base lies before you. Capture it!"

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_1_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate enemy destroyers."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_2_T0"
msgstr "Destroy enemy cruisers."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_3_T0"
msgstr "Destroy enemy battleships."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_4_T0"
msgstr "Destroy enemy warships."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_01_T0"
msgstr ""
"Focus on capturing the Key Area to weaken the enemy base's defense systems."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_02_T0"
msgstr "Focus on capturing the Key Area to weaken the enemy repair ships."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_03_T0"
msgstr "Focus on capturing the Key Area to weaken air support."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_11_T0"
msgstr "The forts at the enemy base pose a significant threat. Destroy them!"

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_12_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate the aircraft carriers to clear the skies!"

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_13_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate the repair ships to prevent warships from regenerating HP."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RESP_1_T0"
msgstr "Each respawn costs time and energy. Fight efficiently!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LINE_1"
msgstr ""
"The first line of enemy defenses lies before you. Capture the Key Areas to "
"break through to the next line. Make haste!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LINE_2"
msgstr ""
"The defense systems of the Citadel of Return are live. Capture the Key Areas"
" to weaken the base defenses. It is the only way to gain an advantage for "
"your attack."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LINE_3"
msgstr ""
"Commanders of the Alliance, the Citadel base lies before you. Capture it to "
"determine the battle's outcome!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LINE_SWITCH_CAP"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, your coordinated actions have weakened the defenses at the enemy"
" base. We have received its exact location. Move to the next line of attack."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LINE_SWITCH_TIME"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, the gathered intelligence data gave you the exact location of "
"the enemy base. Move to the next line of attack."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_LOSS"
msgstr ""
"That is unfortunate, Commanders. You have failed to complete the Operation's"
" primary task. We're forced to activate the system restart."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_BASE_CARRIERS"
msgstr ""
"Eliminate the aircraft carriers at the enemy base to clear the skies of "
"enemy aircraft."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_BASE_FORTS"
msgstr "Destroy the forts at the enemy base. They pose a significant threat."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_BASE_REPAIRS"
msgstr ""
"Eliminate the repair ships at the enemy base to prevent enemy warships from "
"regenerating HP."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_CP_CARRIERS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on capturing the Key Area to weaken the air "
"support at the enemy base."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_CP_FORTS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on capturing the Key Area to weaken the enemy"
" base's defense systems."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_CP_REPAIRS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on capturing the Key Area to weaken the enemy"
" repair ships."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_ALL"
msgstr "Enemy warships detected. Eliminate them to weaken the defense forces."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_BB"
msgstr ""
"Enemy battleships detected. Eliminate them to undermine their fighting "
"capabilities. "

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_CA"
msgstr ""
"Enemy cruisers detected. Eliminate them to disrupt the enemy formations."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_DD"
msgstr "Enemy destroyers detected. Eliminate them to gain the upper hand."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_FAST_CAP"
msgstr ""
"Capture the nearest Key Area before the countdown ends. Otherwise, you will "
"lose the advantage."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_SEC_RESPAWN"
msgstr "Each respawn costs time and energy. Fight efficiently."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_START"
msgstr ""
"Commanders of the Alliance of New Earth, you are approaching the base of the"
" Citadel of Return. Capture it before the future is irreversibly changed. "
"World stability depends on you!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_ATTACK_VOICE_WIN"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, you have managed to complete a difficult task in capturing the "
"enemy base. World stability is under control!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_CHARACTER_SABER"
msgstr "SABER-777 Strategic Framework"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_1_T0"
msgstr "Do not let the Citadel of Return capture Key Areas!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_2_T0"
msgstr "Defend the Key Areas to maintain the efficiency of our base defenses!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_MAIN_LINE_3_T0"
msgstr "The base is under attack! Protect it at all costs!"

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_1_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate enemy destroyers."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_2_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate enemy cruisers."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_3_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate enemy battleships."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DESTROY_4_T0"
msgstr "Eliminate enemy warships."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_01_T0"
msgstr "Stay in control of at least one Key Area before the countdown ends."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_02_T0"
msgstr "Prevent the enemy from reaching the Key Areas. Hold your positions!"

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_11_T0"
msgstr "Focus on defending the Key Area to maintain base defense efficiency."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_12_T0"
msgstr ""
"Focus on defending the Key Area to keep the repair ships at full strength."

msgid ""
"IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RANDOM_DOMINANCE_13_T0"
msgstr "Focus on defending the Key Area to maintain air support efficiency."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_BATTLE_MESSAGE_SECONDARY_RESP_1_T0"
msgstr "Each respawn costs time and energy. Fight efficiently!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LINE_1"
msgstr ""
"The first line of defense lies before you. Protect the Key Areas to keep the"
" defense systems of our base intact."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LINE_2"
msgstr ""
"The forces of the Citadel of Return have breached the first line of defense."
" Protect the Key Areas to maintain the efficiency of our base defenses. That"
" is the only way to gain an advantage during their final attack."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LINE_3"
msgstr ""
"Commanders of the Alliance, our base is under attack! Protect it at all "
"costs! The stability of the future depends on it!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LINE_SWITCH_CAP"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, our defensive line has been breached. The base is weakening. "
"Move to the next line, and coordinate your actions."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LINE_SWITCH_TIME"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, our defensive line has been breached. Move to the next line."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_LOSS"
msgstr ""
"That is unfortunate, Commanders. You have failed to complete the Operation's"
" primary task. We're forced to activate the system restart."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_CP_CARRIERS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on defending the Key Area to maintain air "
"support efficiency at our base."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_CP_FORTS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on defending the Key Area to maintain the "
"efficiency of our base defenses."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_CP_REPAIRS"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, focus your efforts on defending the Key Area to maintain the "
"efficiency of the repair ships at our base."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_ALL"
msgstr ""
"Enemy warships detected. Eliminate them to weaken the attacking forces."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_BB"
msgstr ""
"Enemy battleships detected. Eliminate them to undermine their fighting "
"capabilities."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_CA"
msgstr ""
"Enemy cruisers detected. Eliminate them to disrupt the enemy formations."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_DESTROY_DD"
msgstr "Enemy destroyers detected. Eliminate them to gain the upper hand."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_FAST_CAP"
msgstr ""
"Stay in control of at least one Key Area before the countdown ends. "
"Otherwise, you will lose the advantage."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_INTRUDERS"
msgstr ""
"Prevent the enemy from reaching Key Areas. Hold your positions! We need "
"intelligence data to develop our technology."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_SEC_RESPAWN"
msgstr "Each respawn costs time and energy. Fight efficiently."

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_START"
msgstr ""
"Commanders of the Alliance of New Earth, you are tasked with the defense of "
"our base. The enemy is inbound; do not let them breach our defenses. The "
"stability of the future depends on you!"

msgid "IDS_EV_MODERN_ERA_PVE_DEFENCE_VOICE_WIN"
msgstr ""
"Commanders, you have managed to complete a difficult task, having endured "
"the enemy assault. World stability lies in your hands!"

