"The map is divided into three areas, each subdivided into sectors. You can "
"only claim sectors adjacent to ones you already control."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each area can be upgraded, adding an extra reward to every sector within it."
" Areas can be upgraded even while you're still claiming sectors. Additional "
"rewards for sectors already claimed are granted immediately."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The most valuable rewards are highlighted on the map. Plan the shortest "
"route to reach them efficiently!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Linked Sectors"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Some sectors are linked and affect the availability, rewards, or claim cost "
"of other sectors."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_HEADER"
msgstr "Sectors With Enemy Artillery"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Claiming artillery sectors unlocks linked sectors under fire."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_5_HEADER"
msgstr "Sectors With Enemy Ships"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_5_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Can only be claimed after claiming a certain number of sectors."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_6_HEADER"
msgstr "Sectors Granting Additional Rewards"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_6_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Claim sectors with aircraft carriers to increase rewards in linked sectors."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_7_HEADER"
msgstr "Sectors Reducing Claim Cost"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_7_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Claim radar sectors to reduce the cost of linked sectors in Battle Points."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_8_HEADER"
msgstr "Extra Rewards"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_8_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Certain sectors unlock bonus rewards. To unlock them, first capture the main"
" sector. Bonus rewards can be earned repeatedly."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_UPGRADE_PURCHASE_COST"
msgstr "Purchase price:"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_UPGRADE_SUBTITLE_YOU_WILL_RECEIVE_AFTER_CLAIMING_NEW_PROVINCE"
msgstr "These additional rewards will become available for unclaimed sectors:"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_UPGRADE_SUBTITLE_YOU_WILL_RECEIVE_AFTER_UPGRADE"
msgstr "Upgrading grants the following rewards for claimed sectors:"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_UPGRADE_SUBTITLE_YOU_WILL_RECEIVE_BECAUSE_REGION_DONE"
msgstr "Upgrading grants the following rewards for claimed sectors:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_GRAND_STRATEGY_PASS_UPGRADE_TITLE"
msgstr "Confirmation"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_LEARNSKILLS_HEADER"
msgstr "Mastering Commander Skills"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_LINK_MULTIBOOST"
msgstr "Link bonuses"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Experimental Ships"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Try out experimental ships featuring new experimental mechanics! These ships"
" are available for a limited time and will be removed from your account in "
"Update 14.7."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You can unlock an experimental ship by researching all of her components."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Researching Components"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You can research an experimental ship's components by exchanging Credits and"
" Action Reports, which are earned through combat missions."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Once all components are researched, the ship will be unlocked, and you can "
"proceed to the next ship in the group."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Group Research Reward"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_MINIDOCKYARD_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Unlock all ships in the group to receive the group research reward, which "
"will be credited to your account in Update 14.7."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Research Bureau"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Resetting Progress for a Tech Tree Branch"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Your progress for a particular branch of ships can be reset only if you have"
" already researched the Tier X ship of the branch. The number of resets is "
"unlimited."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "After research progress has been reset:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "All ships of the branch (including modules) will be sold."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_4"
msgstr ""
"Any XP that has not been converted into Free XP will be transferred to the "
"Tier I ship."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_5"
msgstr ""
"Camouflages, flags, signals, and expendable economic bonuses will be "
"removed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_6"
msgstr ""
"Linked bonus packages and permanent camouflages will continue to be "
"available for ships when you research them again."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_7"
msgstr "Upgrades will be demounted free of charge."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_8"
msgstr "Commanders will be sent to the Reserve."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Obtaining Battle Performance Bonuses"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Battle Performance Bonuses mark ships that are eligible to earn Research "
"Points, and are placed on the ships of any reset branches. Resetting the "
"research progress of a branch for the first time can earn players an "
"increased number of Research Points. To get these, simply enter a battle "
"with a ship of a reset branch with a Battle Performance Bonus and win, or "
"earn the required amount of Base XP. If you reset that branch again, any "
"Battle Performance Bonuses that you have not yet activated will be saved "
"along with any new ones."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"To get Battle Performance Bonuses, research and buy a ship, then helm her in"
" battle and win, or earn the required amount of Base XP."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Unique Items in the Research Bureau"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Battle Performance Bonuses are added along with a special currency—Research "
"Points."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PARAGONS_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Research Bureau section of the Armory offers an array of valuable items "
"that you can get in exchange for Research Points."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Savage Battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Four teams of three ships each take part in the battle. Any team whose ships"
" are completely destroyed is out of the battle. As teams are excluded from "
"the battle, places are distributed in the main results table. The last "
"surviving team wins the battle. The place that each team takes determines "
"the amount of XP and Credits its members earn."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The combat area is surrounded by a circle of Wild Fire that shrinks and "
"eventually forces all participants to engage in close-quarters combat. Ships"
" that stay within the Wild Fire take continuous damage. All ships have saws "
"mounted on their bows that increase the effectiveness of ramming."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"All ships start the battle without any consumables. Consumables are dropped "
"by aircraft during the battle. If a ship manages to seize a dropped "
"consumable, all allied ships also receive one consumable charge from the "
"list of those available. A ship receives one random consumable charge for "
"each enemy ship she destroys."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Factions and Ships"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Three factions are involved in the Savage Battle: Octopus, Moray Eel, and "
"Barracuda. The ships of each faction have their own distinctive features:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The ships of the Octopus faction are hard to detect and have powerful "
"torpedo armament, but they don't have main battery guns."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The ships of the Moray Eel faction are maneuverable and are stronger in "
"close range encounters, but they don't have main battery guns."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_4"
msgstr ""
"The ships of the Barracuda faction are fast and have powerful main battery "
"guns, but their torpedo armament does not deal a lot of damage and takes a "
"long time to reload."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE004_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_5"
msgstr ""
"Each faction has ships of three tiers: VIII, IX, and X. Tier VIII ships are "
"given to players at the start of the event. Tier IX and X ships can be "
"obtained by completing combat missions."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Asymmetric Battle Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Rules and Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Event duration: 14 days."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Asymmetric Battle features teams comprising a differing number of ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Tier VII–X ships are allowed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Tokens"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Participate in the Asymmetric Battle playing Tier VII–VIII ships to earn "
"Battle Tokens that unlock access to this battle type for Tier IX and X "
"ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"To enter battle with a particular ship, use Battle Tokens to get an order."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Adding Battle Tokens"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "The number of Tokens earned depends on the ship tier:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier VII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Tier VIII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_4"
msgstr "Tier IX: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE007_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_5"
msgstr "Tier X: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Rules of the Twilight Hunt"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Sixteen players are pitted against each other in Twilight Hunt battles. When"
" a battle starts, you are completely on your own, but as the battle unfolds,"
" you can join efforts and set up a team with other players. In battle, you "
"will also be confronted by ships of the Twilight Fleet."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"With the start of the event, you will immediately have access to six "
"Twilight Hunt ships. During the event, you will also be able to enter battle"
" playing ferocious sea monsters you can get by completing combat missions."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Event Stages"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "The event is spread over three stages lasting one week each."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each stage increases the difficulty of the battle, but at the same time, the"
" reward for destroying Twilight Fleet ships becomes ever more enticing."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Each new stage also increases the maximum number of players per team from "
"three up to six."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Reward"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Your main goal is to collect as many Battle Points as possible. You'll need "
"them to progress through combat missions."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Battle Points can be earned for destroying ships of the Twilight Fleet. If "
"you choose to sink the ship helmed by another player, all the Battle Points "
"earned by the player in that battle will be yours."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Some time into the battle and Rasputin, the flagship of the Twilight Fleet, "
"will put out to sea, seeking prey. Destroy the mirky battleship to get the "
"maximum Battle Points. Double the number of Battle Points you've earned by "
"exiting battle through the Portal."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_HEADER"
msgstr "Teams"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"During battle, you can set up teams. You can leave a team at any moment."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Playing in a team provides a considerable advantage in battle but any Battle"
" Points you've earned will be divided equally between all team members."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE009_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"You can also enter battle within a Division that you've created in the Port."
" Changing teams has no effect on the line-up of your Division."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Arms Race Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Buffs"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Pick up buffs to enhance the combat characteristics of your team's ships and"
" aircraft squadrons."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Key Area"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Capture the Key Area to earn more points."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE016_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"A Key Area will appear some time after the battle starts. The capture area "
"will gradually shrink."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Convoy"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"When you enter a battle, you will be randomly assigned to either the "
"attacking or escorting team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The attacking team must destroy all enemy transport ships before they reach "
"their destination point or destroy all ships on the escorting team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The escorting team is tasked with the mission to ensure the safe arrival of "
"at least one transport ship to the destination point or destroy all ships on"
" the attacking team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams of 12 ships each take part in the battles. You can enter battle "
"either solo or in a Division of up to three participants."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE017_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier VIII–X ships can participate."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Twilight Battle Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In Twilight Battle, two teams confront each other in a conflict that is not "
"time-limited. To win, your team must destroy all ships on the opposing team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The battle zone is encircled by the Filth and steadily shrinks. If you find "
"your ship in the Filth, you will start taking continuous damage from it. The"
" amount of damage depends on your ship type."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE018_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Teams of seven players each will set a course into battle at the helms of "
"Tier IX ships equipped with special consumables. These ships have been "
"specifically designed for the event."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Trouble in the Hot Tub"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"A serious skirmish has broken out between rubber duckies plowing the waters "
"of Cap's hot tub."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The duckies appear armed to the teeth (or rather, beaks!). Even sea mines "
"are in play—a useful way to keep enemies at bay. And if some nimble duckie "
"manages to sneak up close to her enemy, she may well end up bouncing off the"
" nearest inflatable toy!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Two teams of seven duckies each take part in the battles."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Battles involve Tier X duckies and superduckies—all available in this event "
"only."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE019_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Fowl play is encouraged!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Asymmetric Battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You will be fighting against a team of bots twice the size of your team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You, however, will outmatch your foes in terms of combat capability—you can "
"plunge into battles at the helms of higher-tier ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Tier VII–X ships are allowed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams—one of five and the other of twelve ships—take part in battles. "
"Divisions are not allowed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Battles involve Tier IX and X ships. Your opponents will be helming ships of"
" Tier VII and VIII."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Adding Battle Tokens"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "The number of Tokens earned depends on the ship tier:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier VII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Tier VIII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_4"
msgstr "Tier IX: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE020_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_5"
msgstr "Tier X: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Concealed Maneuvers"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Aircraft carriers with a special tactical role can participate in battles. "
"Attack aircraft of carrier Taihō have the ability to generate smoke screens "
"that conceal allied forces. Bombers of carrier Essex can deploy sea mines to"
" deter enemy forces."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Battles are fought in the Domination mode."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams of nine ships each take part in the battles. You can enter battle "
"either solo or in a Division of up to three players."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE021_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Tier IX–X ships of all types are allowed to participate. Aircraft carriers "
"with the new consumables can participate in battles."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE024_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Convoy"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE024_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Rules and Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE024_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"When you enter a battle, you will be randomly assigned to either the "
"attacking or escorting team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE024_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The mission of the escorting team is to ensure the safe arrival of at least "
"one transport ship to the destination point or destroy all ships on the "
"attacking team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE024_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The attacking team must prevent the transport ships from reaching their "
"destination point at all costs or destroy all ships on the escorting team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Airship Escort"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Each team is tasked with the mission to escort the allied airship to the "
"destination point before the enemy team or to destroy all enemy ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Both airships move continuously, but each team can change their travel "
"speed. An airship will move at a higher speed if only allied ships are "
"nearby; an airship will slow down if at least one enemy ship sneaks in and "
"stays in the vicinity."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The airship reaches her maximum speed when the allied team simultaneously "
"slows down the enemy airship and speeds up their own airship."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_4"
msgstr ""
"An airship's speed doesn't depend on the number of ships of the same team "
"next to it."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams of 12 ships each take part in the battle. You can enter battle "
"either solo or in a Division of up to five participants."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE025_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier VIII–X ships can participate."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Asymmetric Battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You will be battling against a team of bots that outnumbers your team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You, however, will outmatch your foes in terms of combat capability—you can "
"plunge into battles at the helms of higher-tier ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams—one of five and the other of twelve ships—take part in the "
"battles. You can enter battle either solo or in a Division of up to five "
"participants."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each battle sees a smaller team of player-controlled Tier VI–X ships of all "
"types, including superships, go up against a larger team comprised of "
"Tier IV–IX bot ships of all types, excluding submarines."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Your allied ships can be one tier higher or lower than your own ship, while "
"enemy ships will always be one or two tiers lower than your ship."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Adding Battle Tokens"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "The number of Tokens earned depends on the ship tier:"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier VII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Tier VIII: 200 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_4"
msgstr "Tier IX: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE027_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_5"
msgstr "Tier X: 0 Tokens per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Piñata Hunt"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr "The Piñata Hunt season is now open!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"A fancy camouflage with llamas will disguise your ship and help you blend in"
" with the Piñata's habitat."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Stock up on special support consumables to gain an advantage for your team. "
"Break the Piñata as close to your team as possible to have a better chance "
"of capturing the Key Area."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_4"
msgstr ""
"Once the Piñata is destroyed, you will see a gradually shrinking Key Area. "
"Capture it to get more points."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Support Consumables"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You can obtain support consumables by completing combat missions or you can "
"purchase them from the Armory."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Damage the Piñata and pick up the support consumables it drops to give your "
"team an advantage."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Rules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams of seven hunters face off against each other in the battle. "
"Divisions are allowed. "

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE028_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Piñata hunters enter each battle playing Tier VIII–IX ships equipped "
"with support consumables."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Omaha Beach Assault"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Allied forces are assaulting Omaha Beach! Allied command is trying to "
"minimize losses by rescuing crews from ships in distress. At the same time, "
"the enemy has received reinforcements and is trying to hold back the "
"assault by all means available—by laying minefields and shelling ships from "
"coastal positions."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Assist the Allies in achieving the objectives of the Operation and executing"
" a successful landing despite the numerous obstacles."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Upon completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including "
"Classified Documents detailing hostile forces."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Classified Documents"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Use Classified Documents to gain strategic advantages in battle. They can "
"improve your ship's performance against specific enemy types: ship types, "
"mines, or coastal guns."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to complete the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE030_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to receive Stars. They will allow you to obtain"
" intelligence about enemy forces and other rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Atlantic Wall Defense"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In this Operation, you will have the opportunity to oppose the Allies and "
"fight on the side of Germany. The Kriegsmarine command has transferred "
"additional forces from Norway, but despite this, the enemy has managed to "
"gain a foothold on the neighboring section of the coast."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You must repel the Allied advance in Normandy and thwart their attempt to "
"land on your site."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"By completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including "
"Classified Documents."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Classified Documents"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Use Classified Documents to gain strategic advantages in battle. They can "
"improve your ship's performance against specific enemy types: ship types, "
"mines, or coastal guns."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to complete the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE032_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to receive Stars. They will allow you to obtain"
" intelligence about enemy forces and other rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Utah Beach"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"The beach codenamed \"Utah\" was the westernmost area of the Allied landings"
" in Normandy. It was here, under the dark of dawn on June 6, 1944, that the "
"monumental operation for the liberation of Europe began to unfold."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You will dive into the atmosphere of the historic battle and join the Allied"
" troops in their assault."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"When completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including "
"Classified Documents."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Classified Documents"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Classified Documents provide advantages in battle and improve your ship's "
"performance against specific enemy materiel: ship groups, mines, or coastal "
"guns."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to complete the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE033_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to receive Stars and obtain Classified "
"Documents about enemy forces, as well as other rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Mode Shuffle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You will be fighting alongside other players in a battle between two teams of 12 ships. You can enter battle either solo or in a Division of up to three participants.\n"
"\n"
"The game mode and map are randomly selected out of three options: Epicenter, Convoy, or Airship Escort."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Epicenter"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Score the maximum points before the enemy team by capturing zones and "
"destroying their ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Convoy"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Plunge into battles for maritime convoys on either the attacking or "
"escorting side. Your mission is to defend or destroy transport ships headed "
"toward their destination point."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_HEADER"
msgstr "Airship Escort"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE034_RULES_PARAGRAPH_4_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Escort the allied airship to the destination point before the enemy team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "The Borg Invasion"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Feel like a true member of Starfleet as you fight the Borg in the battle for"
" Vulcan's fate!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Borg are focusing on Vulcan's strategic facilities, with plans to "
"assimilate the scientists and steal advanced technologies. It's up to you "
"and your team to protect Vulcan and repel the Borg assault."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"When completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including unique "
"ship modules."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Ship Modules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You can enhance and customize each ship in your Port to perform specific "
"roles in battle using unique ship modules. These modules, tailored for "
"Vulcan, Romulan, and Klingon ships, allow you to adjust their parameters, "
"armaments, and consumables."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary task to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE035_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to obtain ship modules, as well as other "
"rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Vulcan's Riposte"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Feel like a true member of Starfleet as you fight the Borg in the battle for"
" Vulcan's fate!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Borg are focusing on Vulcan's strategic facilities, with plans to "
"assimilate the scientists and steal advanced technologies. It's up to you "
"and your team to protect Vulcan and repel the Borg assault."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"When completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including unique "
"ship modules."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Ship Modules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You can enhance and customize each ship in your Port to perform specific "
"roles in battle using unique ship modules. These modules, tailored for "
"Vulcan, Romulan, and Klingon ships, allow you to adjust their parameters, "
"armaments, and consumables."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary task to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE036_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to obtain ship modules, as well as other "
"rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Queen's Rage"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Feel like a true member of Starfleet as you fight the Borg in the battle for"
" Vulcan's fate!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The Borg are focusing on Vulcan's strategic facilities, with plans to "
"assimilate the scientists and steal advanced technologies. It's up to you "
"and your team to protect Vulcan and repel the Borg assault!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"When completing Operation tasks, you will receive rewards, including unique "
"ship modules."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Ship Modules"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You can enhance and customize each ship with unique ship modules in your "
"Port to perform specific roles in battle. These modules, tailored for "
"Vulcan, Romulan, and Klingon ships, allow you to adjust their parameters, "
"armaments, and consumables."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary task to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE037_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Complete secondary tasks to unlock ship modules and other rewards."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Unbreakable Line"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Team up to attack the enemy in close combat and claim victory through "
"relentless pressure!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "All ships can rejoin the battle after being destroyed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Return to Battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE038_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Ships on both teams rejoin the battle a few seconds after being destroyed. "
"There is no limit on how many times this can happen."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Perilous Route"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Escort the damaged command ship to her destination."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Fend off enemy attacks and complete main and secondary tasks to ensure she "
"reaches her destination safely."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Command Ship"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"With her systems damaged and guns disabled, the command ship advances toward"
" her destination as the crew works on repairs. If she survives the journey, "
"she will take part in the final battle as a powerful ally."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Support Consumables"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You have access to support consumables that provide a boost for the entire "
"team, including the command ship."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE039_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Plan their use carefully—charges are limited."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Arctic Convoy"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In this Operation, you and your team must locate and escort allied transport"
" ships to the rendezvous point. From there, they will proceed to Allied-"
"controlled waters. The transports are scattered across the region and "
"require your protection."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Expect fierce enemy attacks and the threat of minefields."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Convoy"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Stay close to the transport ship to ensure she keeps moving."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Without your support, the transport ship will stop, making it an easy target"
" for enemy attacks."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE040_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete secondary tasks to earn Stars and obtain \"'39–'45 Chronicles\" "
"collection elements, as well as other rewards in the \"In the Name of "
"Tomorrow\" event. The more Stars you earn, the more rewards you will "
"receive."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Tokyo Express"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"The Operation is conducted under the cover of darkness. Your mission is to "
"locate and eliminate the enemy destroyers transporting supplies for the "
"ground forces."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Expect poor visibility, enemy reinforcements, and the presence of a capital "
"ship."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Illuminated Areas"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Beware of illumination flares and fires left at the locations of destroyed "
"ships. Entering these areas will instantly increase your detectability."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Take advantage of darkness to conceal your movements and illumination to "
"expose enemy forces."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE041_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete secondary tasks to earn Stars and obtain \"'39–'45 Chronicles\" "
"collection elements, as well as other rewards in the \"In the Name of "
"Tomorrow\" event. The more Stars you earn, the more rewards you will "
"receive."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Pacific Offensive"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In this Operation, you and your teammates must advance and capture key "
"islands in coordination with cruiser San Diego."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Expect waves of enemy reinforcements and heavy coastal battery fire."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "USS San Diego"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Cruiser San Diego plays a vital role in the Operation. Coordinate with her "
"during the capture of islands, as San Diego's presence is required to secure"
" control. Provide cover and ensure her survival."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE042_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete secondary tasks to earn Stars and obtain \"'39–'45 Chronicles\" "
"collection elements, as well as other rewards in the \"In the Name of "
"Tomorrow\" event. The more Stars you earn, the more rewards you will "
"receive."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "World War II Operations"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Each Operation is a representation of the key battles of a specific period "
"of World War II and unfolds in different regions where major military "
"actions took place."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"You can participate in escorting transport ships through northern waters as "
"part of the Arctic Convoy, engage the enemy in night battles in the South "
"Pacific, or conquer strategically important positions alongside renowned "
"warship San Diego."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Operations"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In Operation Arctic Convoy, your objective is to escort transport ships and "
"make sure they reach Allied-controlled waters. Transport ships move only "
"when you stay close; otherwise, they stop and become easy targets for the "
"enemy. Be prepared to face ferocious, hostile ships and navigate dangerous "
"minefields."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Operation Tokyo Express unfolds at night. You must locate and eliminate "
"hostile destroyers transporting supplies for Axis forces. Try to avoid the "
"illuminated zones on the map, as entering them will immediately increase "
"your detectability."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"In Operation Pacific Offensive, you will fight alongside renowned cruiser "
"San Diego and capture key enemy positions across the islands. To succeed in "
"the Operation, coordinate with San Diego and do not let the enemy destroy "
"her."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to achieve victory in the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE043_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete secondary tasks to earn Stars and obtain \"'39–'45 Chronicles\" "
"collection elements, as well as other rewards in the \"In the Name of "
"Tomorrow\" event. The more Stars you earn, the more rewards you will "
"receive."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Blast From the Past: 2015"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Feel the nostalgia and dive back into the most memorable years of World "
"of Warships!"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each stage of the event focuses on a particular year in the game's history, "
"and you can enter battle only on ships released that year or earlier."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "Only surface ships are allowed."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Participation Conditions"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Two teams of 12 ships take part in battle. You can either enter battle solo "
"or within a Division of up to four participants."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Tier V–VI ships can participate."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE044_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Submarines and aircraft carriers are not allowed in battle. During the last "
"two weeks of the event, hybrid ships and ships with special mechanics will "
"also be excluded."

