msgstr "Temporal Rift"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Operations"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"As a result of a temporal distortion, the forces of the New Earth Alliance "
"have been thrown into an alternate past where the Citadel of Return has "
"opened a portal from the future, disrupting the course of history. Your "
"mission is to capture and hold the enemy base to seal the rift."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Key Mechanics"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"All ships can rejoin the battle after being destroyed. You can choose a "
"sector on the map to respawn in."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"All event ships are armed with missiles. You can also mount event upgrades "
"to adjust your playstyle."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Operation Tasks"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Complete the primary tasks to win the Operation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE050_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Complete the secondary tasks to earn Stars and obtain rewards, including "
"ships and upgrades. The more Stars you earn, the more rewards you will "
"receive."

