msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Unbreakable Front"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Team Mission"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Score 1,000 points before the enemy team by capturing Key Areas and "
"destroying their ships."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Both teams also start with a home base; capturing the enemy base results in "
"an instant victory."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Respawns"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "When your ship is destroyed, a countdown begins."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Choose a sector on the map to respawn in. If you don't select one before the"
" timer expires, a sector will be chosen for you."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"Upon respawning, all consumables and armament will be ready and reloaded, "
"except for torpedoes. If your ship is destroyed while torpedoes are still "
"reloading, they will start a new reloading cycle upon respawning; if they "
"were fully reloaded, they will remain ready."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Consumables"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVE053_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Take advantage of special consumables with ship-specific or team-wide "
"effects, available only in this battle type."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Last Voyage of Transylvania"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"The Portal to the dark dimension is open again, and unspeakably evil forces "
"are spilling into our world! The battlefield is completely encircled by the "
"Filth; any allied ships that enter it will continuously lose hit points, "
"while hostile forces within it become more resilient to incoming damage."

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Transylvania casts a magic area around her that repels the Filth. The magic "
"is waning, however, and the safe area will gradually shrink over time."

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Goal"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Only Transylvania can put an end to this saga. You need to escort her to the"
" Portal so she can wipe it off the face of earth!"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Buffs"

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"A modifier will be applied to your ship in battle that will change her "
"combat characteristics. Each ship on your team will receive a buff for each "
"allied ship that sinks."

msgid ""
"IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO031_EV_HL_23_E02_HALLOWEEN_2023_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Collect Shards of the Great Towers to increase Transylvania's damage "
"resistance."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_HEADER"
msgstr "Operations With Flagships"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In Operations, your team needs to complete various tasks while fighting "
"bots. Each Operation has a unique scenario and story elements."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"An Operation will be selected randomly, and its complexity will depend "
"on the different tiers and types of ships on your team."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "Flagships"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"In these Operations, you will face flagships—powerful warships with "
"increased hit points, led by admirals who command the enemy fleet according "
"to their specializations."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Flagships can enhance enemy ships within the command area and give them "
"special abilities."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_HEADER"
msgstr "Goal and Rewards"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_1"
msgstr "To win, your team needs to achieve the primary goal."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_PCVO032_OP_FLAGSHIPS_DROP_RULES_PARAGRAPH_3_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"The more additional missions you complete during the Operation, the more "
"resources you'll receive."

