msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_PASSIVE_PHASE_MESSAGE_OVERCHARGE"
msgstr "The docks are silent. Area boosts are no longer available."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_POSTPROGRESSION_REWARDS_CLAIM"
msgstr "Claim"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_POSTPROGRESSION_REWARD_LABEL"
msgstr ""
"You've completed the construction and upgrades of all areas and now have "
"access to an Extra Reward. All Naval Base Supplies will be accumulated here."
" Each time you fill the progress bar, you will receive a Liberty Harbor "
"Collection Token."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RESOURCE_REQUIRED"
msgstr "Required: %(price)s"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RETRY"
msgstr "Try again"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_REWARD"
msgstr "Reward"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_REWARDS_RECEIVED"
msgstr "Rewards received"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_REWARD_EXPEDITIONS_INFO"
msgstr "Obtained on expedition start"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_REWARD_RECEIVED"
msgstr "Reward received"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE"
msgstr "Area Upgrades"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Upgrading areas to new levels increases the number of missions you can "
"accept or expeditions you can dispatch. Level upgrades also grant Memory "
"Notes and rewards, including Tier VIII cruiser Bridgeport."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Levels"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Areas have Intermediate Stages between Levels. Each Intermediate Stage "
"upgrade increases your chance of receiving a double reward mission or "
"expedition in this area. It also grants you a Liberty Harbor Collection "
"Token."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Intermediate Stages"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_AREAS_UPGRADE_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"You can upgrade all areas to Level 3, except for Memory Box. Upgrades "
"enhance the area's capabilities."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Construct and upgrade areas using Naval Base Supplies. You can earn them "
"from combat missions in the Naval and Operational Command areas, as well as "
"from expeditions in Military Port."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each area can be upgraded to Level 3. New levels improve the area's benefits"
" and change its appearance."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Construction"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"As you build and upgrade the Liberty Harbor Naval Base, you will receive "
"Memory Notes that tell tales of the U.S. Navy's history."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Once you've constructed and upgraded all areas of Liberty Harbor, you will "
"receive the main reward—Tier VIII cruiser Bridgeport."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Upgrades"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_BASICS_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"The Liberty Harbor Naval Base has five areas designed for different types of"
" activities: Military Port, Naval Command, Operational Command, Fuel "
"Terminal, and Memory Box. All areas can be upgraded except for Memory Box."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Each expedition has specific requirements, including Fleet Power—the "
"combined power of all ships you assign to it."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Select suitable ships and dispatch the expedition once assembled. Ships sent"
" on an expedition will be temporarily unavailable for other expeditions."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"The number of available expeditions depends on the Military Port level."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Expeditions"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "You can either dispatch one-day or three-day expeditions."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Three-day expeditions require less Fleet Power and grant higher rewards upon"
" dispatch, but your ships will be unavailable for other expeditions for a "
"longer period."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_2_TEXT_3"
msgstr ""
"One-day expeditions require more Fleet Power, but dispatching them daily "
"will bring more resources over the same three-day period than a single "
"three-day expedition."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Expedition Duration"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_EXPEDITIONS_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"Dispatch your ships on expeditions from the Military Port area to earn Naval"
" Base Supplies for construction and upgrades. Ships on expeditions remain "
"available for battle."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_HEADER"
msgstr "Rules"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_HEADER_GO_BACK"
msgstr "Back to Liberty Harbor"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr "You can unlock extra missions or expeditions by boosting areas."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr "Boosts are available for a limited time."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Using Boosts"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Upgrading Fuel Terminal allows you to assign additional extra missions or "
"expeditions to other areas. At Level 3, you can boost two areas "
"simultaneously."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Fuel Terminal Levels"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_OVERCHARGE_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"Fuel Terminal is an auxiliary area that boosts Naval and Operational Command"
" with extra combat missions, plus Military Port with extra expeditions."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"You will receive Memory Notes as you upgrade the Liberty Harbor areas. "
"Unlocking a Memory Note will bring you a reward that you can collect in "
"Memory Box."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each Memory Note recalls a notable moment from the history of the U.S. Navy."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Memory Notes"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Collecting the final reward will unlock access to Extra Rewards. All Naval "
"Base Supplies you earn afterward will be accumulated in the progress bar of "
"the Memory Box area."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_2_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"Each time you fill the progress bar, you will receive a Liberty Harbor "
"Collection Token."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Extra Rewards"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PHOTO_ALBUM_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"Memory Box is where you can view the Memory Notes you've collected. It also "
"shows your overall progress in the event."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"The higher the area level, the larger the list of combat missions you can "
"choose from."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"At Level 3, you can complete up to seven combat missions per day. You can "
"only accept as many missions at a time as the current area level allows (up "
"to %(maxAmount)s)."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "The list of combat missions refreshes daily."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Combat Missions"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Each day, you have a chance to receive a double reward mission. The base "
"chance is 10%, but you can increase it by upgrading the area through "
"Intermediate Stages."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Double Reward Missions"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVE_MISSIONS_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"In the Operational Command area, you can accept missions to complete in Co-"
"op Battles, Operations, and temporary battle types."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"The higher the area level, the larger the list of combat missions you can "
"choose from."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_2"
msgstr ""
"At Level 3, you can complete up to seven combat missions per day. You can "
"only accept as many missions at a time as the current area level allows (up "
"to %(maxAmount)s)."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TEXT_3"
msgstr "The combat mission list refreshes daily."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_1_TITLE"
msgstr "Combat Missions"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr ""
"Each day, you have a chance to receive a double reward mission. The base "
"chance is 10%, but you can increase it by upgrading the area through "
"Intermediate Stages."

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_RULE_2_TITLE"
msgstr "Double Reward Missions"

msgid "IDS_NAVAL_BASE_RULES_MODAL_PVP_MISSIONS_TITLE"
msgstr ""
"In the Naval Command area, you can accept missions to complete in Random, "
"Ranked, and Brawl Battles."

