msgid "IDS_NEWBIE_QUESTS_CLAN_BATTLE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Clan members can fight in Clan Battles, as well as build and upgrade the "
"Clan Base to obtain additional resources and discounts. You can join a Clan "
"or create one of your own."

msgid "IDS_NEWBIE_QUESTS_CLAN_BATTLE_NAME"
