msgstr ""
"Battle stations! The enemy forces have regrouped to attack Key Areas under "
"our control. Hold off the enemy assault!"

msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_CAPTURE_ZONE_2_LVL_4"
msgstr ""
"Commander, capture that Key Area held by the enemy! To complete the "
"objective, ensure no enemy ships remain within the Key Area."

msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_CAPTURE_ZONE_2_LVL_5"
msgstr ""
"Commander, capture that Key Area held by the enemy! To complete the "
"objective, ensure no enemy ships remain within the Key Area."

