msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_KILL_CV_1_LVL_5"
msgstr ""
"Attention, Commander! Intelligence reports two aircraft carriers among the "
"enemy forces. Locate and eliminate them to relieve pressure on our "
"positions!"

msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_KILL_DDS"
msgstr ""
"Attention, Commander! Our intelligence reports that an enemy strike force is"
" hidden in the smoke screen. Detect and eliminate it!"

msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_KILL_THE_PLANES"
msgstr "Enemy aircraft spotted. AA gun crews to battle stations!"

msgid "IDS_OP_17_LOW_LVL_3_SOUND_SPOT_BY_PLANES"
msgstr ""
"An aircraft carrier is part of our task force. She will provide "
"reconnaissance and air cover, and launch strikes against enemy ships."

