"I speak for the Collective. I am the beginning. The End. The one who is "
"many."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_BEFORE_LOSE"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_BEFORE_LOSE_CHAT"
