"A minor setback. Our assimilation of Vulcan continues. An imperfect victory "
"by imperfect beings."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2_CHAT"
