"You have achieved a tactical victory, but your ultimate failure is "
"inevitable. We are Borg."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_3"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_1_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_3_CHAT"
