msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Your temporary successes are meaningless. We will assimilate Vulcan and all "
"of its knowledge. You will become one with Us."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Your defiance ends now. We will integrate Vulcan's knowledge. Embrace the "
"Collective."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_3"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_BATTLE_START_3_CHAT"
msgstr "I am Borg. Your defeat approaches. Resistance is futile."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Why do you challenge the Collective? Disruption will not be tolerated."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"You have only delayed the inevitable. We will soon end your insignificant "
"existence."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_3"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_FAKEWIN_3_CHAT"
msgstr "Your victory is insignificant. We will overcome your final defenses."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_1_CHAT"
msgstr "They will become one with the Borg."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_2_CHAT"
msgstr "Now, they are all Borg."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Your victory is meaningless. Stop resisting, we will deliver you from chaos "
"into order."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"You were successful here, but we are coming. Your extinction is near. We. "
"Are. Borg."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_FAKE_WIN"
msgstr ""
"We have secured our facilities and technologies! Focus on the remaining "
"tasks."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_2_MAINTASK"
msgstr "Capture 3 Key Areas before time runs out."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_ALERT_1"
msgstr ""
"Orbital Strike alert! Leave the area or restore shields immediately to "
"withstand the impact!"

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_ALERT_2"
msgstr "Orbital Strike alert! Move to safety or restore shields immediately!"

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_ALERT_3"
msgstr "Orbital Strike alert! Brace for impact!"

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_ALERT_4"
msgstr ""
"Orbital Strike alert! You will only survive the impact with active shields!"

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_BIG_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_BIG_1_CHAT"
msgstr "Such defiance is futile. The Collective cannot be stopped."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_BIG_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_BIG_2_CHAT"
msgstr "Your defenses are irrelevant. Witness the Collective's power."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_HUGE_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_HUGE_1_CHAT"
msgstr "Your end is inevitable. We will personally oversee your assimilation."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_HUGE_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_HUGE_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"The time of resistance is over. We will finish what the drones could not."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"You have destroyed one, but the Collective endures. You will be assimilated."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Feel the power of the Collective. The Queen commands, the hive follows!"

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_3"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_ABILITY_ORBITAL_STRIKE_SMALL_3_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"A minor setback. The Collective adapts and overcomes. Resistance is futile."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_BATTLE_START_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_BATTLE_START_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Assimilation will be completed. You will become one with the Borg. "
"Resistance is futile."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_BATTLE_START_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_BATTLE_START_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Resistance is futile. You cannot stop the Borg. Your final defeat "
"approaches."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Impressive, but futile. I am beyond your reach. The Collective will prevail."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"You have surprised me, but your efforts are in vain. I am invulnerable. You "
"will be assimilated."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_3"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PHASE_3_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Your resistance is stronger than anticipated, but you cannot harm me now. I "
"will adapt and assimilate you all."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Your resistance was futile. By assimilating Vulcan into our Collective, we "
"are bringing them closer to perfection."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_LOST_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Despite your failure, you have shown interesting qualities. We will add your"
" distinctiveness to our own."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_1"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_1_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"You think in such three-dimensional terms. How small you've become. We will "
"return."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2"
msgstr " "

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_BOSS_PLAYERS_WON_2_CHAT"
msgstr ""
"Do you think you have destroyed us? We will adapt and resume. We are Borg."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_DEFEAT_1"
msgstr ""
"We fought bravely, but the enemy overpowered us. Perhaps there was a better "
"approach."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_DEFEAT_2"
msgstr ""
"We fought valiantly, but the enemy overpowered us. Perhaps there was a more "
"efficient strategy."

msgid "IDS_OP_E13_3_MAINTASK_1"
msgstr ""
"Attention, all units! Eliminate the three minions before they capture Key "
