"February 1940 and entered service in August 1942. In 1943, the battleship "
"was temporarily assigned to the Home Fleet to protect arctic convoys, but "
"she was later sent to the Pacific Ocean to participate in operations against"
" Japan. Alabama participated in the campaign in the Mariana Islands and the "
"Philippines campaign, and she also supported the assault on Okinawa in 1945."
" The battleship currently serves as a museum ship in Mobile Bay, Alabama."

