msgid "IDS_PCVE007_PROMO_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Dive into a battle between teams that are unequal in terms of the number of "
"ships in their lineup but are equal in firepower!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE009"
msgstr "Twilight Hunt"

msgid "IDS_PCVE009_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Everyone fights on their own, but can team up with other players. Your main "
"goal is to earn as many Battle Points as you can."

msgid "IDS_PCVE009_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Earn Battle Points by fighting solo against all other players or by teaming "
"up with other players to reach for victory as a pack."

