" are inferior in terms of combat power."

msgid "IDS_PCVE027_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Take a stand in a situation where your foes outnumber you!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE028"
msgstr "Piñata Hunt"

msgid "IDS_PCVE028_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Try out support consumables: They provide boosts for your whole team so you "
"can take a good swing at the Piñata!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE028_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Try out support consumables in the Piñata battle."

msgid "IDS_PCVE030"
msgstr "Omaha Beach Assault"

msgid "IDS_PCVE030_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Assist the Allies in overcoming the challenges of landing on Omaha Beach! "
"Complete Operation tasks to obtain Classified Documents and boost the combat"
" characteristics of your ship."

msgid "IDS_PCVE030_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Assist the Allies in overcoming challenges off the coast of Omaha Beach."

msgid "IDS_PCVE032"
msgstr "Atlantic Wall Defense"

msgid "IDS_PCVE032_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Resist the Allied forces on the Normandy coast! Use Classified Documents "
"that provide intel about your adversaries to gain a strategic edge in "
"battle."

msgid "IDS_PCVE032_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Resist the Allied forces."

msgid "IDS_PCVE033"
msgstr "Utah Beach"

msgid "IDS_PCVE033_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Support the Allies off the shores of Normandy! Complete Operation tasks and "
"obtain Classified Documents to boost the combat characteristics of your "
"ship."

msgid "IDS_PCVE033_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Ensure the successful landing of Allied troops."

msgid "IDS_PCVE034"
msgstr "Mode Shuffle"

msgid "IDS_PCVE034_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Fight against real players in a randomly chosen game mode: Epicenter, "
"Convoy, or Airship Escort."

msgid "IDS_PCVE034_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Fight against real players in a randomly chosen game mode."

msgid "IDS_PCVE035"
msgstr "The Borg Invasion"

msgid "IDS_PCVE035_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Borg have launched a relentless assault on Vulcan, targeting our scientists and technology.\n"
"\n"
"Defend Vulcan and repel the Borg attack!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE035_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Repel the Borg attack."

msgid "IDS_PCVE036"
msgstr "Vulcan's Riposte"

msgid "IDS_PCVE036_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Borg have managed to capture certain strategic facilities on Vulcan. Their invasion is continuously spreading, and now a new region is being attacked.\n"
"\n"
"Take back the Key Areas captured by the Borg!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE036_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Take back Key Areas captured by the Borg."

msgid "IDS_PCVE037"
msgstr "Queen's Rage"

msgid "IDS_PCVE037_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Your resistance has not been futile! Your success in liberating facilities and rescuing scientists has enraged the Borg Queen.\n"
"\n"
"Prepare for a decisive battle!"

msgid "IDS_PCVE037_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Destroy the Borg fleet and Queen's Annihilator."

msgid "IDS_PCVE038"
msgstr "Unbreakable Line"

msgid "IDS_PCVE038_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Engage in swift, intense battles and return to the fight once your ship is "
"destroyed."

msgid "IDS_PCVE038_MATCHMAKER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Fight. Sink. Repeat."

msgid "IDS_PCVE039"
msgstr "Perilous Route"

msgid "IDS_PCVE039_BANNER_TITLE"
msgstr "Battle Features"

msgid "IDS_PCVE039_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
