msgid "IDS_PCVO003_OP_01_03_S03_LABYRINTH_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A sudden night attack on the allied aircraft-carrying squadron turned out to"
" be catastrophic—all escort ships were lost, and the aircraft carrier Raptor"
" was badly damaged. Extensive damage incapacitated the ship. Your task force"
" is ordered to find the carrier, repair the ship and escort her from the "
"danger zone."

msgid "IDS_PCVO003_OP_01_03_S03_LABYRINTH_GOAL"
msgstr ""
"Escort the support ships to the carrier Raptor. Take out the carrier from "
"the action zone."

