msgid "IDS_PCZC103_WOWS_MORESOVIETDESTR"
msgstr "Need more DDs"

msgid "IDS_PCZC103_WOWS_MORESOVIETDESTR_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In Update 0.6.2, we added an alternative branch of Soviet destroyers, and it turned out a success. The main branch, with Khabarovsk on top, is well-suited to a playstyle based on cruiser-like artillery engagements. Staying on the move, maintaining constant fire, and delivering lightning-fast strikes – a thrilling combat experience guaranteed.\n"
"\n"
"The playstyle of the alternative branch, headed by Grozovoi, will be closer to that of classic destroyers with effective torpedoes and guns used in support."

