msgstr "Badge of Destroyer Opportune"

msgid "IDS_PCZC114_NY2018_OPPORTUNEEMBLEM_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"HMS Opportune, commissioned in 1942, was an O-Class destroyer, one of the first ships of her class built under the War Emergency Program to serve with the so-called Emergency Flotilla of destroyers.\n"
"\n"
"In December 1943, Opportune, and other destroyers of the 36th Division escorting convoy RA-55A, were detached from the convoy and deployed to join the pursuit of Scharnhorst. The ship took part in the final torpedo attack on the limping battleship, scoring two successful hits."

