msgid "IDS_PCZC116_NY2018_SCHARNHORST_SHIP"
msgstr "Battleship Scharnhorst"

msgid "IDS_PCZC116_NY2018_SCHARNHORST_SHIP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Battleship Scharnhorst was commissioned into the fleet in 1939. She was one of the first \"high-speed\" battleships of the new generation. The maximum speed of this well-armored giant, with a displacement of 37,000 tons, was 31 knots. None of the Allied ships that could pose a threat to her could keep up with her.\n"
"\n"
"The intention of Germany to respect the international restrictions in the early stage of designing the ship resulted in the fact that only 283 mm guns were mounted on her. That meant she could be classified as a battlecruiser, and reduced her capability to face the newest British battleships on an equal footing."

