msgid "IDS_PISB720"
msgstr "Conte Verde"

msgid "IDS_PISB720_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"A battleship armed with sixteen 203 mm main guns. Such a ship could have "
"been built to take advantage of a large incomplete hull that could not be "
"finished to its intended design due to naval treaties placing limits on main"
" gun caliber. The Italian 203 mm gun was a very potent weapon for its time. "
"The hull could have been refitted in the late 1930s with improved anti-"
"aircraft and secondary batteries."

msgid "IDS_PISB720_FULL"
msgstr "Conte Verde"

msgid "IDS_PISB720_NUMBER"
