msgid "IDS_PISB909"
msgstr "AL Marco Polo"

msgid "IDS_PISB909_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"A Sardegnian battleship of the fourth \"special plan ship\" series—an advanced version of Vittorio Veneto. She is ambitious and eager to improve herself. Although proud, Marco Polo is cheerful and friendly. She will do whatever it takes to achieve her own goals.\n"
"From the Azur Lane game."

msgid "IDS_PISB909_FULL"
msgstr "AL Marco Polo"

msgid "IDS_PISB909_NUMBER"
msgstr "1"

msgid "IDS_PISB909_YEAR"
msgstr "1936"

msgid "IDS_PISB990"
msgstr "A. Vespucci"

msgid "IDS_PISB990_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"A hypothetical project that is a variant of the development of Italian ships"
" based on the Vittorio Veneto class and a battleship project for the "
"U.S.S.R. with a displacement of 42,000 tons. The increase in firepower could"
" have been achieved by increasing the number of guns and turrets: quadruple-"
"gun turrets with 381 mm guns were in development in the late 1910s and early"
" 1920s."

msgid "IDS_PISB990_FULL"
msgstr "Amerigo Vespucci"

msgid "IDS_PISB990_NUMBER"
msgstr "1"

msgid "IDS_PISB990_YEAR"
