msgstr ""
"A unique hybrid ship that combines the features of a battleship and an "
"aircraft carrier. Initially built as a version of the preceding Fusō class, "
"Ise underwent extensive reconstruction in the 1940s. Some of the ship's main"
" battery turrets were replaced by an aircraft hangar, surmounted by a flight"
" deck."

