msgid "IDS_PJSC727_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"In Chinese tradition, dragons are usually depicted as long, scale-covered, "
"snake-like creatures with four legs. Four brothers—the Kings of Dragons—each"
" represent one of the four seas. The name of the Dragon King of the East Sea"
" is Ào Guǎng."

