"draft to improve their seaworthiness. Kamikaze was laid down under the name "
"Destroyer No. 1 in 1921. Seven years later, the destroyer received her own "
"name. In World War II, she was involved in the Aleutian Islands Campaign and"
" escorted ship convoys to remote outposts in the Kuril Islands. In 1945, "
"Kamikaze was reassigned to the Combined Fleet, and she formed part of the "
"escort for both Ise-class battleships as they sailed from Singapore "
"to Japan."

msgid "IDS_PJSD025_FULL"
msgstr "Kamikaze"

