msgstr "Isokaze"

msgid "IDS_PJSD803_DESCR"
msgstr "Destroyer Isokaze, which is used in the Introductory Mission"

msgid "IDS_PJSD889"
msgstr "STAR Kitakaze"

msgid "IDS_PJSD889_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"A ship captured by a space crystal. Created by a celestial body to "
"communicate with humans, Andromeda's avatar realizes that its behavior is "
"becoming aggressive and tries to help humanity find out why the crystal came"
" down to Earth."

msgid "IDS_PJSD889_FULL"
msgstr "STAR Kitakaze"

msgid "IDS_PJSD889_NUMBER"
msgstr "0"

msgid "IDS_PJSD889_YEAR"
msgstr "1942"

msgid "IDS_PJSD890"
msgstr "AL Shimakaze"

msgid "IDS_PJSD890_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"The only destroyer of her class in service to the Sakura Empire. Not only "
"does she have high speed and powerful torpedoes, but she also possesses a "
"passionate heart and a good sense of humor and wit. Although she can be "
"clumsy at times and often gets in trouble, she always turns it into a "
"victory. From the Azur Lane game."

msgid "IDS_PJSD890_FULL"
msgstr "AL Shimakaze"

msgid "IDS_PJSD890_NUMBER"
msgstr "1"

msgid "IDS_PJSD890_YEAR"
