msgid "IDS_PXSA003_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"Nobilium, the pinnacle of engineering excellence built on the experiences of the past and discoveries of the future. The ship's hull is made of a rare sky alloy. Apart from sophisticated aircraft, carriers are armed with ancient artifacts. Any of the carriers can use those artifacts to disable enemy ships and restore the HP of allies.\n"
"\n"
"Damage dealt by the Filth: 500 HP per second."

