msgstr "PICARD"

msgid "IDS_PXSA008_CAPTAIN_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The captain of Starship Enterprise, a wise and diplomatic leader with rich "
"experience. A former archaeologist, he has high morals and principles."

msgid "IDS_PXSA008_CAPTAIN_SUBHEADER"
msgstr "Captain"

msgid "IDS_PXSA008_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"Numerous Earth sea-going vessels and spacecraft have borne the name "
"Enterprise. The United Federation of Planets continued this proud tradition "
"by naming its starships Enterprise. The fifth vessel, the Enterprise-D, "
"explored the vastness of space under Captain Picard's command."

