msgid "IDS_PXSA807"
msgstr "Ranger"

msgid "IDS_PXSA807_DESCR"
msgstr ""
"The first U.S. aircraft carrier of special construction. The ship carried a "
"large air group, and she was quite fast for her type. Her drawbacks include "
"a lack of torpedo protection and an impractical arrangement of her aircraft "
"elevators, which slowed down the handling of air groups."

msgid "IDS_PXSA807_FULL"
msgstr "Ranger"

