"mines—that's what Luigi McQuacci was famous for in the police academy. "
"However, many years have passed since the legendary duck took off his badge,"
" said his goodbyes to Cap's crew, and retired to his home pond. But his "
"plans for a quiet life changed when he learned that a gang of wild geese was"
" running loose in the city and that they had kidnapped the love of his life."
" Luigi McQuacci is prepared to do anything to save her, even to blow the "
"dust off his Engine Whoosh!"

