"inspired awe in his rivals with his high firing rate, high-explosive "
"bubbles, and mines. Only Cap and Fishy know that this legendary duck is no "
"other than their old companion in arms, Furo. They also know that he can be "
"even faster with his trusty Engine Whoosh. When this veteran stepped back "
"into the ranks, hoping to reunite with his old companions, local geese made "
"it clear that he wasn't welcome; however, Furo doesn't play by the rules, "
"and now a large bounty has been put on his head."

msgid "IDS_PXSC502_FULL"
