"powerful torpedoes, playing havoc with enemy plans to get to Transylvania. "
"It can also hide allied ships from foes' eyes with its smoke generator."

msgid "IDS_PXSD001_FULL"
msgstr "Blade"

msgid "IDS_PXSD001_NUMBER"
