"Don de la DuQue comes from a wealthy and influential duck dynasty whose "
"history has been closely interwoven with Fishy since her very birth. The "
"elegant Don de la DuQue is famous for his speed and maneuverability, but few"
" know of his torpedo and mine armament or his Engine Whoosh with its "
