" teach bad guys lessons according to the Code of the Duck. He is so fast and"
" maneuverable that geese don't even try to run from him—what's the point, "
"when his torpedoes and mines don't leave any chances to get away? And to "
"think they don't even know yet about his improved Engine Whoosh with its "
"increased action time!"

