msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_NORTH"
msgstr ""
"We've received a message indicating the presence of hostile ship activity "
"near the current position of our forces. Locate and cut off all enemy supply"
" lines!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_NORTH_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"We've caught the enemy off guard. Now, they have no choice but to vacate the"
" territory. Signaling to flagship—mission completed!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_SOUTH"
msgstr ""
"Our squadron has bumped up against enemy forces in this territory, intense "
"fighting is ongoing. To change the course of the battle, we need to act "
"promptly and deal a deadly blow to the most dangerous targets."

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_SOUTH_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"All designated targets are down. We've seized the initiative from the enemy "
"and shifted the course of battle in our favor!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_START"
msgstr ""
"Got a signal from the flagship. We've been ordered to proceed to the "
"designated coordinates, quell enemy resistance, and take the territory under"
" control."

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_CASUAL_START_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"Signaling successful mission completion. All enemy resistance in the "
"designated territory has been suppressed."

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_GLOBAL"
msgstr ""
"An order has been issued to take control of strategically important "
"territories. The course of events in the entire theater of operations hinges"
" on success in this direction!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_GLOBAL_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"We have sufficient territories under our control to tip the balance in our "
"favor!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_HARD_END"
msgstr ""
"The enemy is cornered but not crushed. We are in for the hardest and most "
"decisive battle. Now is the time to prove your worth. Let's bring down the "
"major hostile forces!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_HARD_END_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"The fierce battle ended with the enemy suffering a resounding defeat. The "
"territory is under our full control!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_CENTER"
msgstr ""
"The squadron is proceeding to seize the shore bridgehead. We're tasked with "
"a mission to escort and support the landing. Drive the adversary away and "
"assist the amphibious ships in reaching their destination!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_CENTER_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"Incoming message: Bridgehead captured successfully. With our support, the "
"amphibious ships have successfully broken through to the shore!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_NORTH"
msgstr ""
"Enemy forces are heavily concentrated in this area. Engaging them head-on "
"would put us at a disadvantage. I suggest striking unexpectedly and "
"employing smoke tactics."

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_NORTH_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"We've disrupted the lines of communication and mixed up the enemy squadron's"
" orders. The territory remains under our control."

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_SOUTH"
msgstr ""
"The signal watch has reported inbound light signals. Our squadron base in "
"the nearby territory is under attack!"

msgid "IDS_TERRITORY_MESSAGE_TEXT_MIDDLE_SOUTH_COMPLETED"
msgstr ""
"Reporting. The assault from the indicated direction was effectively "
"repulsed, enemy forces pushed back. All hands, stand down from action "
"stations."

