msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_7"
msgstr "SKILL_TREE_USE"

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_8"
msgstr ""
"Receive additional XP and Credits for completing daily missions in Random "
"and Ranked Battles."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_9"
msgstr "Complete combat missions and get valuable rewards."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_11_0"
msgstr ""
"Economic bonuses will allow you to earn more Credits, as well as Ship, "
"Commander, and Free XP after each battle."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_11_1"
msgstr ""
"Expendable bonuses applied to a ship are removed after each battle played. "
"Permanent bonuses can be applied once and do not need to be resupplied."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_11_2"
msgstr ""
"You can receive economic bonuses for participating in various events or "
"purchase them for Doubloons."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_12_0"
msgstr ""
"Use upgrades to build on your ship's strengths while adjusting their "
"weaknesses."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_12_1"
msgstr ""
"Upgrades help reduce the risks of fire and flooding, increase main battery "
"durability, and improve other characteristics. The higher a ship's tier, the"
" more upgrades she can take advantage of."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_12_2"
msgstr ""
"You can mount standard, special, and unique upgrades on your ships. Special "
"and unique upgrades can be purchased in the Armory."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_13_0"
msgstr ""
"Commanders earn Commander XP after each battle. Accumulating it earns them "
"skill points."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_13_1"
msgstr ""
"You can use skill points to master Commander skills and improve "
"characteristics like detectability range, shell-type switching time, and "
"artillery reload time."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_13_2"
msgstr ""
"Commanders must be retrained before they can be assigned to a different "
"ship. Commander skills remain inactive until retraining is complete."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_14_0"
msgstr ""
"Signals improve your ship's speed, firing range, fire extinguishing time, "
"and many other characteristics."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_14_1"
msgstr ""
"Signals on a ship are removed after each battle and automatically mounted "
"again if available."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_14_2"
msgstr ""
"Signals can be purchased or obtained by participating in various activities."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_15_0"
msgstr ""
"You can mount two types of camouflage on your ships: expendable and "
"permanent."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_15_1"
msgstr ""
"Expendable camouflages mounted on a ship are removed after each battle "
"played. Permanent camouflages are not spent in battle and do not need to be "
"resupplied."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_15_2"
msgstr ""
"Camouflages can be obtained by participating in various activities, as well "
"as purchased in exchange for Credits or Doubloons."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_1600_0"
msgstr ""
"Ranked Battles are only available during an active Ranked Battles season."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_1600_1"
msgstr ""
"Achieving victories in Ranked Battles, progressing through the qualification"
" stage, and climbing to Rank 1 will reward you with Steel, Doubloons, "
"economic bonuses, and other items. The higher the league you reach, the "
"bigger the rewards."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_1600_2"
msgstr ""
"Ranks are divided into three leagues: Bronze, Silver, and Gold. To enter the"
" next league, you need to reach Rank 1 in your current league and then "
"qualify by earning a certain number of Stars at Rank 1."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_17_0"
msgstr ""
"You earn XP and Credits after every battle. You can use these to research "
"and purchase ships or upgrade your ships by purchasing new modules."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_17_1"
msgstr ""
"In the game, you have access to ships of various types and nations: sneaky "
"destroyers, versatile cruisers, heavily armored battleships, carriers with "
"fast and devastating aircraft on board, and elusive submarines. Choose your "
"role in battle!"

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_1_0"
msgstr "Join other players to fight a team of bots."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_1_1"
msgstr "Team size: 9 vs. 9"

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_21_0"
msgstr "Containers are granted for XP earned in battles."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_21_1"
msgstr ""
"When you collect your daily containers, you can choose your type of reward "
"or try your luck for a Supercontainer that can drop an exceptionally "
"valuable reward."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_22_0"
msgstr ""
"Campaigns consist of missions, each mission with several tasks. You can take"
" on up to three tasks simultaneously."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_22_1"
msgstr ""
"You will receive stars for completing tasks. Stars grant access to "
"subsequent missions."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_22_2"
msgstr ""
"Completing campaigns will bring you ultimate rewards like unique Commanders "
"or Premium ships."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_23_0"
msgstr ""
"Manage your Inventory and receive Credits for selling items you no longer "
"need. You can sell modules, signals, upgrades, camouflages, and economic "
"bonuses."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2403_0"
msgstr "Fight alongside other players in Random Battles between two teams."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2403_1"
msgstr "The maximum team size in Random Battles is 12 vs. 12."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2403_2"
msgstr ""
"If you are interested in unique scenarios, try Operations—a battle type with"
" story-driven tasks where you team up with other players to fight bot ships."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2403_3"
msgstr ""
"To win an Operation, complete the primary task. Completing additional tasks "
"will earn you more resources per battle."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2403_4"
msgstr ""
"One of the available Operations is selected randomly. Its complexity depends"
" on the ship tiers fielded by your team."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_24_0"
msgstr ""
"Dive into missions of various Operations, each with unique story elements, "
"and fight against bots together with your teammates."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_24_1"
msgstr ""
"Each Operation has a primary task you need to complete. These tasks vary "
"from defending naval bases to escorting ships."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_24_2"
msgstr ""
"You will also have a set of additional tasks you can complete to earn more "
"resources per battle."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_24_3"
msgstr ""
"The matchmaker randomly selects Operations. The complexity of an Operation "
"depends on the tiers and types of ships on your team."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2827_0"
msgstr ""
"Join a Clan to find like-minded players to fight alongside, speed up your "
"progress in the game owing to access to bonuses and resources, and open the "
"doors to additional activities to participate in."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2827_1"
msgstr ""
"During a Clan Battles season, you can face off against other players in Clan"
" Battles to climb up through leagues and earn rewards."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_2827_2"
msgstr "You can also hone your skills in Training Battles."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3029_0"
msgstr ""
"In the Armory, you can exchange your earned resources for various valuable "
"items and take part in themed activities."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3029_1"
msgstr ""
"You can obtain ships, Port slots, containers, economic bonuses, upgrades, "
"signals, camouflages, patches and recruit seasoned and unique Commanders."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3029_2"
msgstr ""
"In the Armory, you can also purchase Doubloons, days of Premium Account, and"
" much more."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3105_0"
msgstr ""
"If you don't have enough XP to research a ship or a module, use your Free "
"XP."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3105_1"
msgstr ""
"You receive Free XP equivalent to 10% of XP earned in each battle (before "
"modifiers are applied)."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3105_2"
msgstr ""
"You can convert XP earned with Elite, Premium, and special ships into Free "
"XP."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3_0"
msgstr "Fight alongside other players in a battle between two teams."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_3_1"
msgstr "Maximum team size: 12 vs. 12"

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_9_0"
msgstr ""
"Completing combat missions will help you obtain valuable in-game items, "
"speed up your game progress, and allow you to upgrade your fleet more "
"efficiently."

msgid "IDS_UNLOCKS_DESCRIPTION_9_1"
msgstr ""
"Combat missions are automatically completed as you progress in the game. You"
" can concentrate on specific missions to obtain the rewards that interest "
"you the most."

